{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"479f8a5dd0e6392c374f793f6909a0cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@FutureMrsGlover&amp;nbsp; We&#039;re looking at the family RIU because we will most likely have&amp;nbsp;a few children attending the wedding, otherwise I would have Secrets Wild Orchid on the list!&amp;nbsp; We stayed there a few years ago and loved it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I will definitely let you know how we like the Royalton, I&#039;ll take and post pics.&amp;nbsp; It looks gorgeous, and the reviews on TripAdvisor&amp;nbsp;have been getting better and better since they opened.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!&amp;nbsp; Looking forward to finally picking a resort and getting the save the dates out.&amp;nbsp; Exciting times for all of us!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1847856,"PostDate":1398975444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@FutureMrsGlover\u00a0 We're looking at the family RIU because we will most likely have\u00a0a few children attending the wedding, otherwise I would have Secrets Wild Orchid on the list!\u00a0 We stayed there a few years ago and loved it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I will definitely let you know how we like the Royalton, I'll take and post pics.\u00a0 It looks gorgeous, and the reviews on TripAdvisor\u00a0have been getting better and better since they opened.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!\u00a0 Looking forward to finally picking a resort and getting the save the dates out.\u00a0 Exciting times for all of us!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"100.1.15.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f039fced6eafa639e3039792dcb6612","RawContent":"Cool ideas.... Good Luck and Congrats. Please post some pics when you come back.  I&#039;m sure your wedding is going to be awesome!!!\n[quote name=\"shugapop1\" post=\"1846167\" timestamp=\"1398427686\"]\ngood morning ladies, although I am not  a 2015 bride, I  am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. [u]My wedding is June 7, 2014[\/u] at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn&#039;t have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I&#039;m so close I&#039;m pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i&#039;ll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.  for my pre wedding dinner, I&#039;m giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I&#039;m putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I&#039;m giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do  not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie&#039;s wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie&#039;s wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you&#039;s.[\/quote]\nHappily Ever After, \n\nThey all seem great and very professional.  Have you made your decision yet? lol.  Yeah, the candle will burn out, or they use the jerk sauce and toss the bottle. lol.  As long as it is something nice and inexpensive, its a win-win in my book.  \n\nHave you started looking for your dress?  [quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1846806\" timestamp=\"1398592381\"]\nWOW \n\nThe candle idea sounds so  beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between \n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/\"]http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/[\/url]\n\nDecisions decisions....!!!!\n\nCongratulations Shugapop1 \n\nYour wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!\n\nShow some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.\n\nCongrats again.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1847906,"PostDate":1398993766,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Cool ideas.... Good Luck and Congrats. Please post some pics when you come back. \u00a0I'm sure your wedding is going to be awesome!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>shugapop1, on 25 April 2014 - 04:08 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>good morning ladies, although I am not\u00a0 a 2015 bride, I\u00a0 am however a Jamaica bride(we girls gotta stick together no matter what year) lol. <u>My wedding is June 7, 2014<\/u> at Sandals Whitehouse. we were able to do sandals, because we didn't have any children attending so it worked for us. my biggest with them was all the great inclusions that I get\/got from them and I truly, truly love , love, love, did I mention I love the property.Because they also have a themed night every night, it also gives my guest lots of things to do onsite and slop party everynight on resort.Since I'm so close I'm pretty much done with everything. if anyone needs any help\/ideas, let me know, i'll do all I can. for my gifts\/favors I did several things.\u00a0 for my pre wedding dinner, I'm giving a gift bags(custom kraft bag) inside I did double wall tumbler with custom label on it, inside tumbler I'm putting margarita pack with custom label on it. I'm giving key card holder with lanyard, a thank you card, a custom cd, and I made door hangers,one side says \"please do\u00a0 not disturb, we are resting for trevor and Kellie's wedding, flip side \"please do not disturb we are recovering from Trevor and kellie's wedding\". On the table for reception I did message in a bottle thank you's.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><br \/><p>Happily Ever After,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They all seem great and very professional. \u00a0Have you made your decision yet? lol. \u00a0Yeah, the candle will burn out, or they use the jerk sauce and toss the bottle. lol. \u00a0As long as it is something nice and inexpensive, its a win-win in my book. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you started looking for your dress? \u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 27 April 2014 - 01:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>WOW\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The candle idea sounds so \u00a0beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elitemediacon...nematography-2\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decisions decisions....!!!!<\/p>\n<br><p>Congratulations Shugapop1\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Show some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats again.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"886af2fafe386eb20d2e2cdfa9a04aab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1846806\" timestamp=\"1398592381\"]\nWOW \n\nThe candle idea sounds so  beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between \n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/\"]http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/[\/url]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/[\/url]\n\nDecisions decisions....!!!!\n\nCongratulations Shugapop1 \n\nYour wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!\n\nShow some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.\n\nCongrats again.[\/quote]\nHi HappilyEverAfter!\n\nWho did you decide to go with for your video?\n\nWould love to know! Thanks!\n\nPam","Attachments":[],"Id":1849005,"PostDate":1399568474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 27 April 2014 - 01:53 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>WOW\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The candle idea sounds so \u00a0beautiful. Such a good idea and something that will last too. (well until they burn it out!) Thanks for the groupon tip too, didnt know that. Im really excited. I just want it to be so perfect and intimate and I have done loads of research on vendors. However I am stuck with who to use to capture the event in HD. Im stuck between\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.reynaldomartin.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/wedding-cinematography-2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elitemediacon...nematography-2\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.yourdaycinema.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Decisions decisions....!!!!<\/p>\n<br><p>Congratulations Shugapop1\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Your wedding is so close now, you must be really excited. Im excited for you!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Show some pics later on if you can. I love the idea of gift bags and would love some help and tips from you too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats again.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi HappilyEverAfter!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Who did you decide to go with for your video?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would love to know! Thanks!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"951ddd9f6a90ce106a9b69d0ce431ac6","RawContent":"Hi Francine, Hi Pamela.  How&#039;s all the planning coming along????? \n\nI have not made a final decision on who i will use yet to do the Cinematography.  At the moment i want to gather up all my prices to see where my budget stands. I really can&#039;t go over budget.  But if all goes well. Reynaldo Martin will be the cinematographer i use to capture my day. Have you looked at his work? It&#039;s a lot like Elite Media Concepts but cheaper. He is my favourite so far.\n\n\nFrancine as for my dress I&#039;m on a serious weight loss programme lol. I have been looking at Jasminesbridalshop.com as they make replica designer dresses and other brides who have used them on this website give rave reviews about them and the prices are very reasonable.  I think I will go with them. I really want to try a blush coloured wedding dress!\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\nSorry my predictor on my phone changed Pam to Pamela. Please forgive me!\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\nPam what are your thoughts on the Cinematography?  \n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849066,"PostDate":1399587416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi Francine, Hi Pamela.  How's all the planning coming along????? <br>\nI have not made a final decision on who i will use yet to do the Cinematography.  At the moment i want to gather up all my prices to see where my budget stands. I really can't go over budget.  But if all goes well. Reynaldo Martin will be the cinematographer i use to capture my day. Have you looked at his work? It's a lot like Elite Media Concepts but cheaper. He is my favourite so far.<br><br>\nFrancine as for my dress I'm on a serious weight loss programme lol. I have been looking at Jasminesbridalshop.com as they make replica designer dresses and other brides who have used them on this website give rave reviews about them and the prices are very reasonable.  I think I will go with them. I really want to try a blush coloured wedding dress!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<br \/>Sorry my predictor on my phone changed Pam to Pamela. Please forgive me!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<br \/>Pam what are your thoughts on the Cinematography?  <br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96ab1f8957e2b580ec2f3ec3c9bce84d","RawContent":"Hey HappilyEverAfter!\n\n\nNo worries on the auto predictor! ;)\n\n\nI&#039;m booking elite media...I think I might book a DJ through them too! \n\n\nI&#039;m having a VERY hard time deciding on a photographer though!\n\n\nWho are you going with??\n\n\n&amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1849137,"PostDate":1399606544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey HappilyEverAfter!<br><br>\nNo worries on the auto predictor! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><br><br>\nI'm booking elite media...I think I might book a DJ through them too! <br><br>\nI'm having a VERY hard time deciding on a photographer though!<br><br>\nWho are you going with??<br><br>\n<3\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fa270017204f6a7ff53c904708b8613","RawContent":"He Pamelas21 Elite Media is a great choice. The package is good with the DJ but for me the dj time is too short.  I know you can get more hours but the cost I can&#039;t justify. My h2b is Jamaican so he promised to sort thst out. \n\n\nFor my photography I&#039;m going with the AMAZING Zuluspro Photography.  Phenomenal artistic photographer and absolutely at the top of his game in artistic approach. There were others bit there to generic for me.  There are so many Great ones. Who&#039;s on your shortlist? \n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849142,"PostDate":1399622487,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                He Pamelas21 Elite Media is a great choice. The package is good with the DJ but for me the dj time is too short.  I know you can get more hours but the cost I can't justify. My h2b is Jamaican so he promised to sort thst out. <br><br>\nFor my photography I'm going with the AMAZING Zuluspro Photography.  Phenomenal artistic photographer and absolutely at the top of his game in artistic approach. There were others bit there to generic for me.  There are so many Great ones. Who's on your shortlist? <br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c603d4149d3e1ed89057d8e3e24fa56","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1849142\" timestamp=\"1399622487\"]\nHey Pamelas21 Elite Media is a great choice. The package is good with the DJ but for me the dj time is too short.  I know you can get more hours but the cost I can&#039;t justify. My h2b is Jamaican so he promised to sort that out. He knows tons of d&#039;s. \n\nFor my photography I&#039;m going with the AMAZING Zuluspro Photography.  Phenomenal artistic photographer and absolutely at the top of his game in artistic approach. There were others bit there to generic for me.  There are so many Great ones. Who&#039;s on your shortlist? \n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk[\/quote]Sent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849145,"PostDate":1399627815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 09 May 2014 - 12:01 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hey Pamelas21 Elite Media is a great choice. The package is good with the DJ but for me the dj time is too short.  I know you can get more hours but the cost I can't justify. My h2b is Jamaican so he promised to sort that out. He knows tons of d's. <br><br>\nFor my photography I'm going with the AMAZING Zuluspro Photography.  Phenomenal artistic photographer and absolutely at the top of his game in artistic approach. There were others bit there to generic for me.  There are so many Great ones. Who's on your shortlist? <br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.218.29.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f5017fab9bf409664bac4151febc707","RawContent":"I don&#039;t know! Lol\n\n\nI contacted:\n\nStacey Clarke\n\nMerrick Cousley\n\nVisual Embrace\n\nMarcia E. Roberts\n\nBrian Nejedly\n\nSaab Weddings\n\nDwayne Watkins - still waiting on his prices\n\nDean Clarke - he&#039;s booked on my day :(\n\n\nIt&#039;s such a big decision!!\n\n\nI&#039;m going to look into Zuluspro Photography!\n\n\nThanks for the suggestion!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849163,"PostDate":1399643550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't know! Lol<br><br>\nI contacted:<br>\nStacey Clarke<br>\nMerrick Cousley<br>\nVisual Embrace<br>\nMarcia E. Roberts<br>\nBrian Nejedly<br>\nSaab Weddings<br>\nDwayne Watkins - still waiting on his prices<br>\nDean Clarke - he's booked on my day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nIt's such a big decision!!<br><br>\nI'm going to look into Zuluspro Photography!<br><br>\nThanks for the suggestion!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d77b57622aa6792b217c5153ea747155","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1849163\" timestamp=\"1399643550\"]\nI don&#039;t know! Lol\n\nI contacted:\nStacey Clarke\nMerrick Cousley\nVisual Embrace\nMarcia E. Roberts\nBrian Nejedly\nSaab Weddings\nDwayne Watkins - still waiting on his prices\nDean Clarke - he&#039;s booked on my day :(\n\nIt&#039;s such a big decision!!\n\nI&#039;m going to look into Zuluspro Photography!\n\nThanks for the suggestion!![\/quote]Your Welcome hun, all the above are good. I wanted to try Dean Clarke but he only books a year in advance, If I didnt get Zuluspro, I would have held out for Dean. Chris of Zuluspro sealed it for us. It all depends on the type of look your going for.\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=RegTGyfRzh4\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=RegTGyfRzh4[\/url]\n\nCheck out this link on you tube. I love his artistry. Im excited. I am doing Engagement, Wedding, TTD and a Boudoir shoot but with more sexiness (classy sexy) with him. Im so excited.","Attachments":[],"Id":1849214,"PostDate":1399654152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 09 May 2014 - 05:52 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I don't know! Lol<br><br>\nI contacted:<br>\nStacey Clarke<br>\nMerrick Cousley<br>\nVisual Embrace<br>\nMarcia E. Roberts<br>\nBrian Nejedly<br>\nSaab Weddings<br>\nDwayne Watkins - still waiting on his prices<br>\nDean Clarke - he's booked on my day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><br><br>\nIt's such a big decision!!<br><br>\nI'm going to look into Zuluspro Photography!<br><br>\nThanks for the suggestion!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Your Welcome hun, all the above are good. I wanted to try Dean Clarke but he only books a year in advance, If I didnt get Zuluspro, I would have held out for Dean. Chris of Zuluspro sealed it for us. It all depends on the type of look your going for.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/RegTGyfRzh4?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Check out this link on you tube. I love his artistry. Im excited. I am doing Engagement, Wedding, TTD and a Boudoir shoot but with more sexiness (classy sexy) with him. Im so excited.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab940286de363c9c4b23959bb11b612f","RawContent":"Omg AMAZING!!! Can&#039;t wait to get a quote!!\n\n\nCongrats on everything hun! So happy for you!\n\n\n&amp;lt;3  and thanks so much for sharing!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1849224,"PostDate":1399655865,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Omg AMAZING!!! Can't wait to get a quote!!<br><br>\nCongrats on everything hun! So happy for you!<br><br>\n<3  and thanks so much for sharing!! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372253473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":134,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
