Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.236.201.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4b9f64b68e189796c13c8ab515745c4","RawContent":"Hi brides! How was your trip to Jamaica @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] ? Do you have any pics and\/or updates for us?","Attachments":[],"Id":1851865,"PostDate":1400853479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi brides! How was your trip to Jamaica @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> ? Do you have any pics and\/or updates for us? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.236.233.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398955837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SoEze","Id":277799,"Name":"SoEze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1400856178,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7070d50f4566ce8251911400c514105","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1851750\" timestamp=\"1400780119\"]\nHi Francine,\n\nIm really doing well with my weight loss. Trying so hard. I dont have a fitness buddy but I&#039;m really on this thing. Down 16 pounds.....loads left still but Im happy. I have my engagement shoot at the end of this year and I wanna look SHAMAZING!!!!!\n\nHow are you doing hun, hows the weight loss and wedding planning?[\/quote]\nThat is great!! @[member=\"happilyeverafter\"]  Good job!! I started last week and so far lost 4.2 lbs.  I\u2019m trying to lose a total of about 20lbs overall.  I especially love how I feel over everything.  I have so much more energy now.  I\u2019ve been exercising, eating healthier and drinking at least one green smoothie a day. \n\nThe wedding planning is going pretty good. I just mailed out invitations so that guests can prepare to save money to make the trip. I\u2019ve been looking at websites for dresses and jotting down names of bridal stores that I plan to visit. Looking at pinterest for ideas of hairstyles, shoes, etc. How\u2019s your planning going?","Attachments":[],"Id":1851874,"PostDate":1400856086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 22 May 2014 - 09:35 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Francine,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Im really doing well with my weight loss. Trying so hard. I dont have a fitness buddy but I'm really on this thing. Down 16 pounds.....loads left still but Im happy. I have my engagement shoot at the end of this year and I wanna look SHAMAZING!!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How are you doing hun, hows the weight loss and wedding planning?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is great!! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276188\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276188-happilyeverafter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">HappilyEverAfter<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Good job!! I started last week and so far lost 4.2 lbs.\u00a0 I\u2019m trying to lose a total of about 20lbs overall.\u00a0 I especially love how I feel over everything.\u00a0 I have so much more energy now.\u00a0 I\u2019ve been exercising, eating healthier and drinking at least one green smoothie a day.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The wedding planning is going pretty good. I just mailed out invitations so that guests can prepare to save money to make the trip. I\u2019ve been looking at websites for dresses and jotting down names of bridal stores that I plan to visit. Looking at pinterest for ideas of hairstyles, shoes, etc. How\u2019s your planning going?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.151.52.42","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3af6e0153c12d72a4279d69de832a19f","RawContent":"Hey Francine!  Glad your on course for weightloss.  My planning is stagnant at the moment. We just saving until it&#039;s time to start paying things off. I want to loose about 60 lbs of weight.  I&#039;m sending my invites at the end of the year or November when j do my engagement shoot\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1851933,"PostDate":1400884794,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Francine!  Glad your on course for weightloss.  My planning is stagnant at the moment. We just saving until it's time to start paying things off. I want to loose about 60 lbs of weight.  I'm sending my invites at the end of the year or November when j do my engagement shoot<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390102734,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2d37a68c6f8662bafc979ec555a85e1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SoEze\" post=\"1851865\" timestamp=\"1400853479\"]\nHi brides! How was your trip to Jamaica @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"] ? Do you have any pics and\/or updates for us?[\/quote]Our trip was great, thank you! We booked the Royalton White Sands for our wedding, it is gorgeous and we are so excited!! I attached some pics  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1852117,"PostDate":1401121045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SoEze, on 23 May 2014 - 05:57 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi brides! How was your trip to Jamaica @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a> ? Do you have any pics and\/or updates for us?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Our trip was great, thank you! We booked the Royalton White Sands for our wedding, it is gorgeous and we are so excited!! I attached some pics \u00a0<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-25851000-1401120901.jpg\" title=\"pool.JPG -  95.89KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-25851000-1401120901.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"pool.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-62591800-1401120908.jpg\" title=\"room.JPG -  57.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-62591800-1401120908.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"room.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-98894300-1401120915.jpg\" title=\"view from the gazebo.JPG -  106.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-98894300-1401120915.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"view from the gazebo.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-72948300-1401120919.jpg\" title=\"wedding gazebo.JPG -  64.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-72948300-1401120919.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"wedding gazebo.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-17355900-1401120927.jpg\" title=\"view from upstairs walkway.JPG -  96.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-17355900-1401120927.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"view from upstairs walkway.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-83205100-1401120929.jpg\" title=\"water sports.jpg -  84.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-83205100-1401120929.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"water sports.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1852117]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-71265800-1401120975.jpg\" title=\"island off the beach.JPG -  60.49KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-276557-0-71265800-1401120975.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"island off the beach.JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.236.100.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd39e8d4ae4dc2601429901b86ab1517","RawContent":"Great! How was the food? Service? I read mixed reviews on TA. I&#039;m still not allowed to view post on here can you email me? Soewedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com  @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"]","Attachments":[],"Id":1852118,"PostDate":1401123072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great! How was the food? Service? I read mixed reviews on TA. I'm still not allowed to view post on here can you email me? Soewedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com  @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soewedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.236.233.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1398955837,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SoEze","Id":277799,"Name":"SoEze","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.17.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c22b3e387707e4b3209f2d79300778c5","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SoEze\" post=\"1852118\" timestamp=\"1401123072\"]\nGreat! How was the food? Service? I read mixed reviews on TA. I&#039;m still not allowed to view post on here can you email me? Soewedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com  @[member=\"Soon2beMrsJ\"][\/quote]\nWe were only there for a few hours since we were staying at the Riu. Everyone who worked there seemed pleasant, and we spoke to a few guests who were happy with everything! We stayed for lunch and it was pretty good!  The reviews on TA are definitely mixed so I&#039;m hoping for the best!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1852132,"PostDate":1401135042,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SoEze, on 26 May 2014 - 08:51 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Great! How was the food? Service? I read mixed reviews on TA. I'm still not allowed to view post on here can you email me? Soewedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com  @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276557\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276557-soon2bemrsj\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2beMrsJ<\/span><\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe were only there for a few hours since we were staying at the Riu. Everyone who worked there seemed pleasant, and we spoke to a few guests who were happy with everything! We stayed for lunch and it was pretty good!  The reviews on TA are definitely mixed so I'm hoping for the best!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391804127,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"781dbbc1fe9e3eab8a53e721a933cd67","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HeatherSSmith876\" post=\"1852242\" timestamp=\"1401215977\"]\nYou can try moon dance cliff resort, its beautiful there. I just did makeup for a bridal party there a few weeks ago. i think their rates are reasonable. They are a villa. If you want to peruse my work, you can go here [url=\"http:\/\/www.inyourfacebeautybarjm.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.inyourfacebeautybarjm.com\/[\/url][\/quote] Thanks @[member=\"heatherssmith876\"] I already chose a villa for the wedding, back in March when I was in Jamaica. I also have a wedding planner, whom plans to do the bridal party make up, but I will check out your site. Are you in Ocho Rios?","Attachments":[],"Id":1852579,"PostDate":1401380245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HeatherSSmith876, on 27 May 2014 - 10:39 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>You can try moon dance cliff resort, its beautiful there. I just did makeup for a bridal party there a few weeks ago. i think their rates are reasonable. They are a villa. If you want to peruse my work, you can go here\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.inyourfacebeautybarjm.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.inyourfacebeautybarjm.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0Thanks @\n\tHeatherSSmith876\n I already chose a villa for the wedding, back in March when I was in Jamaica. I also have a wedding planner, whom plans to do the bridal party make up, but I will check out your site. Are you in Ocho Rios?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28a7d1506700e67892ed6e226c556727","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HeatherSSmith876\" post=\"1852614\" timestamp=\"1401388038\"]\nTha&#039;ts great Francine,  I do not live in Ocho Rios but that&#039;s a problem, Im mobile. I travel to clients.[\/quote]Oh ok. Do you charge a traveling fee? Also, how much do you charge for your service?  Myself and two bridesmaids would need make up for the big day. Thanks @[member=\"heatherssmith876\"]","Attachments":[],"Id":1852616,"PostDate":1401388926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HeatherSSmith876, on 29 May 2014 - 10:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Tha'ts great Francine,\u00a0 I do not live in Ocho Rios but that's a problem, Im mobile. I travel to clients.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh ok. Do you charge a traveling fee? Also, how much do you charge for your service? \u00a0Myself and two bridesmaids would need make up for the big day. Thanks @\n\tHeatherSSmith876\n\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b64fbcc34f53dad1a8b17a484461548a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone! I am new to this site and am in the beginning of the wedding planning process. We have, however booked our resort. We will be getting married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Montego Bay October 24, 2015.&amp;nbsp; :) &amp;nbsp;We ordered our save the dates, so I am excited to send those out soon! Anyone decided on photographers yet or have had their wedding at the Suites and have one to recommend? The resort photographer is rather pricey for what you get so I am looking into others right now. Happy planning everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1853070,"PostDate":1401633759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone! I am new to this site and am in the beginning of the wedding planning process. We have, however booked our resort. We will be getting married at Iberostar Rose Hall Suites in Montego Bay October 24, 2015.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0We ordered our save the dates, so I am excited to send those out soon! Anyone decided on photographers yet or have had their wedding at the Suites and have one to recommend? The resort photographer is rather pricey for what you get so I am looking into others right now. Happy planning everyone!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401627292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b21efea929cbe1db0b8acd6206af3e2b","RawContent":"Thanks for your suggestion! We actually already booked Misha Earle! Very excited :) Her photos look amazing and her prices are good! \n[quote name=\"JoWil JoWil\" post=\"1854141\" timestamp=\"1402063610\"]\n@[member=\"helenk\"] try  [url=\"http:\/\/www.thememory-factory.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.thememory-factory.com\/[\/url]  they are very reasonable. They did my wedding.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1854242,"PostDate":1402152916,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for your suggestion! We actually already booked Misha Earle! Very excited <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Her photos look amazing and her prices are good!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoWil JoWil, on 06 June 2014 - 06:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278186\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278186-helenk\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">helenk<\/span><\/a> try\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.thememory-factory.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.thememory-factory.com\/<\/a>\u00a0 they are very reasonable. They did my wedding.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401627292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":134,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
