{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.52.95.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"69399a58615d967401b586660597ff1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"SoEze\"].....I just returned from my stay at Royalton White Sands....the food was very good.&amp;nbsp; The buffet for breakfast has a lot of choices and was good.&amp;nbsp; On Monday nights they have a Beach party and the food was great.....lamb, jerk chicken, grilled mussels, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The regular rooms are a bit small but we stayed in the presidential suites and it was beautiful.   I put a pictures in the gallery.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855192,"PostDate":1402716380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277799\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277799-soeze\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SoEze<\/span><\/a>.....I just returned from my stay at Royalton White Sands....the food was very good.\u00a0 The buffet for breakfast has a lot of choices and was good.\u00a0 On Monday nights they have a Beach party and the food was great.....lamb, jerk chicken, grilled mussels, etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The regular rooms are a bit small but we stayed in the presidential suites and it was beautiful.\u00a0\u00a0 I put a pictures in the gallery.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397066522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e81092a752b9410caaa1a66002858170","RawContent":"Hello everyone, I am AnnaTennille, and I am getting married at the RIU Tropical Bay Palace in Negril  Jamaica on May 16, 2015. I am a nervous wreck already. I have no clue of what to do, but I am glad  I found this site, it has been really helpful. I just want my day to be  close to perfect as it gets. I had no idea that getting married was so much hard work. I hope I don&#039;t turn into a \" BRIDEZILLA\" but I feel it coming in already, sheesh !","Attachments":[],"Id":1856269,"PostDate":1403202791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello everyone, I am AnnaTennille, and I am getting married at the RIU Tropical Bay Palace in Negril  Jamaica on May 16, 2015. I am a nervous wreck already. I have no clue of what to do, but I am glad  I found this site, it has been really helpful. I just want my day to be  close to perfect as it gets. I had no idea that getting married was so much hard work. I hope I don't turn into a \" BRIDEZILLA\" but I feel it coming in already, sheesh ! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 AnnaTennille & Eric<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 May 16, 2015<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Montego Bay, Jamaica<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:#ff8c00;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 <img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150516\/e\/The+Day+We+Say+I+Do%21\/k\/b124\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"a.johnson1013@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.108.237.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403198680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278601.jpg?_r=1403203318","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atennille","Id":278601,"Name":"atennille","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"89.100.218.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9524d39b0b98940cbd6743d7f76d0aef","RawContent":"@[member=\"atennille\"] congratulations on your engagement, and welcome to bdw :-)  good luck with your planning, this forum is so helpful, it&#039;ll give you all the info out need for your perfect day :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1856316,"PostDate":1403212408,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278601\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278601-atennille\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">atennille<\/span><\/a> congratulations on your engagement, and welcome to bdw :-)  good luck with your planning, this forum is so helpful, it'll give you all the info out need for your perfect day :-) \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"prendest@tcd.ie","IpAddress":"89.100.218.185","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382557289,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274502.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stefadile","Id":274502,"Name":"stefadile","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae29a5745e77d5439b04ec96e697943e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone! I&#039;m getting Married on April 25th, 2015 at the Rosehall Aqueduct and my reception will be at the Iberostar Rose Hall Grand. We just hired a wedding planner from tropical weddings Jamaica. Her name is Almarie and she is amazing! They have great wedding packages. We are still looking for a photographer and videographer, so if you have any suggestions please share :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856388,"PostDate":1403295563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone! I'm getting Married on April 25th, 2015 at the Rosehall Aqueduct and my reception will be at the Iberostar Rose Hall Grand. We just hired a wedding planner from tropical weddings Jamaica. Her name is Almarie and she is amazing! They have great wedding packages. We are still looking for a photographer and videographer, so if you have any suggestions please share <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shauna.phillipskelly@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.241.31.2","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1389749225,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"skelly0386","Id":276089,"Name":"skelly0386","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50d436d4882f4c2bb12c103931a6695e","RawContent":"@[member=\"skelly0386\"] Congrats! I am getting married at the Suites! I booked Misha Earle! Her work is amazing. And budget friendly :) I&#039;ve read great reviews on her and so far via email she&#039;s super accommodating to my millions of questions! Lol\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1856389,"PostDate":1403295838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276089\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276089-skelly0386\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">skelly0386<\/span><\/a> Congrats! I am getting married at the Suites! I booked Misha Earle! Her work is amazing. And budget friendly <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I've read great reviews on her and so far via email she's super accommodating to my millions of questions! Lol<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401627292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.57.232.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5a414448f0bc72d33d7d231bc689cb0","RawContent":"Hey all! I&#039;m getting married at RIU Ocho Rios May 4 2015. Will anyone else be there during that week? We will be there April 30-May 7.","Attachments":[],"Id":1856959,"PostDate":1403755247,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey all! I'm getting married at RIU Ocho Rios May 4 2015. Will anyone else be there during that week? We will be there April 30-May 7.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chyla@cogeco.ca","IpAddress":"24.57.232.156","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308874362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241498.jpg?_r=1403755312","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"May12DPBBride","Id":241498,"Name":"May12DPBBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7cb4b934e23fda7c09672254baca3fed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi All&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My name is Nicole and we are gettting married in Jamaica on Oct 28th 2015. We have not pinned down the resort as yet, but are hoping to do so in the next couple of weeks. How did you all decide what was the right resort for you and your wedding?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857286,"PostDate":1403988908,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi All\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is Nicole and we are gettting married in Jamaica on Oct 28th 2015. We have not pinned down the resort as yet, but are hoping to do so in the next couple of weeks. How did you all decide what was the right resort for you and your wedding?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396402180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f035ad65ee21534db5a8d20e56bfb935","RawContent":"@[member=\"NixSpade\"] Congrats! We are getting married 10.24.15! So close :) \n\n\nWell picking the resort was the hardest decision for us! Well mostly me :) Because I wanted it to be affordable for everyone but was still looking for certain things in a resort for our wedding. \n\n\nWe found Iberostar Rose Hall Suites and it was what we were looking for! It is gorgeous and when I looked at pricing for October it was pretty affordable! I then went on tons of sites reading reviews after reviews because we were not going to be able to do a site visit prior to booking the resort. We didn&#039;t really find any bad reviews and their wedding packages are good so we decided to book it! I would suggest booking soon though because we had originally been looking at a November date but  it was already booked! I was so surprised. It turned out better for us to have an October date anyway because it works better for people with the holidays and all. \n\n\nGood luck and happy planning! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1857327,"PostDate":1404048184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277449\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277449-nixspade\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NixSpade<\/span><\/a> Congrats! We are getting married 10.24.15! So close <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nWell picking the resort was the hardest decision for us! Well mostly me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Because I wanted it to be affordable for everyone but was still looking for certain things in a resort for our wedding. <br><br>\nWe found Iberostar Rose Hall Suites and it was what we were looking for! It is gorgeous and when I looked at pricing for October it was pretty affordable! I then went on tons of sites reading reviews after reviews because we were not going to be able to do a site visit prior to booking the resort. We didn't really find any bad reviews and their wedding packages are good so we decided to book it! I would suggest booking soon though because we had originally been looking at a November date but  it was already booked! I was so surprised. It turned out better for us to have an October date anyway because it works better for people with the holidays and all. <br><br>\nGood luck and happy planning! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401627292,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.182.39.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a69b9143892b0083f15bfe1b423d590","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Francine Braham\" post=\"1828589\" timestamp=\"1390585291\"]\nHi, \n \nMy name is Francine and I am getting married in my home island, Jamaica in June 2015.  I live in NJ. I am so excited, but my fiance and I don&#039;t even know where to start.  We are going to Jamaica in March 2014 for vacation to try to visit a couple resorts and reserve a date for the wedding. \n \nI read a lot of these posts and viewed a lot of beautiful pictures. We want a small wedding of 50 - 60 ppl. I like Sunset Beach resort because it seems to be affordable, but I also like Rosehall Beach Resort because their grounds are beautiful and spacious.  It seems to be more private.\n \nDoes anyone mind sharing how much they spent for their wedding? What were your big money items? Is it best to go with the resort for everything for the ceremony and reception? Or is it cheaper to get vendors outside the resort for things like decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer? Recommendations? I appreciate any feedback.\n \nWhen I go and come back I&#039;ll be sure to update on the forum.\n \nThanks  :)[\/quote]Hi Francine. I also am from NJ but not a 2015 bride. I am getting married this upcoming October in IBRHS because we have children attending the wedding. Just to help you with some of your questions: our wedding budget is $14,000 and that&#039;s including ceremony and reception at the resort. I have included extras for our wedding like a welcome cocktail gathering the Wednesday before the wedding and we also have decorations of our own and we splurged on the favors (we are doing t-shirts). \nThis forum has helped a lot with location reviews and awesome ideas.","Attachments":[],"Id":1857511,"PostDate":1404097260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Francine Braham, on 24 January 2014 - 09:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi,\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nMy name is Francine and I am getting married in my home island, Jamaica in June 2015. \u00a0I live in NJ. I am so excited, but my fiance and I don't even know where to start. \u00a0We are going to Jamaica in March 2014 for vacation to try to visit a couple resorts and reserve a date for the wedding.\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nI read a lot of these posts and viewed a lot of beautiful pictures. We want a small wedding of 50 - 60 ppl. I like Sunset Beach resort because it seems to be affordable, but I also like Rosehall Beach Resort because their grounds are beautiful and spacious. \u00a0It seems to be more private.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nDoes anyone mind sharing how much they spent for their wedding? What were your big money items? Is it best to go with the resort for everything for the ceremony and reception? Or is it cheaper to get vendors outside the resort for things like decorations, flowers, DJ, photographer? Recommendations? I appreciate any feedback.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWhen I go and come back I'll be sure to update on the forum.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThanks\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi Francine. I also am from NJ but not a 2015 bride. I am getting married this upcoming October in IBRHS because we have children attending the wedding. Just to help you with some of your questions: our wedding budget is $14,000 and that's including ceremony and reception at the resort. I have included extras for our wedding like a welcome cocktail gathering the Wednesday before the wedding and we also have decorations of our own and we splurged on the favors (we are doing t-shirts). <br>\nThis forum has helped a lot with location reviews and awesome ideas. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Good Luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>","Email":"ms.tatiana.rivera@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.182.39.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403762681,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Tatimrivera","Id":278701,"Name":"Tatimrivera","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89052451b20e3b2df24ce7d44068a94d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @helenk&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are going down for the Labour day weekend to do a couple of site visits. We are looking at the Royalton and the Iberostar and another one that is being built right now called the Hyatt Ziva Rose. My fist choice is the Hyatt, I don&#039;t know why but I REALLY REALLY want to be married there. we&#039;ll see how it goes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857661,"PostDate":1404191172,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @helenk\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are going down for the Labour day weekend to do a couple of site visits. We are looking at the Royalton and the Iberostar and another one that is being built right now called the Hyatt Ziva Rose. My fist choice is the Hyatt, I don't know why but I REALLY REALLY want to be married there. we'll see how it goes.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396402180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":134,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
