Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"886659b7c7e9254d7b5b664c76b72ef3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;my weddin at sandals whitehouse has now come and gone and it was t ruly amazing. if any of you ladies have facebook, please request me as a friend.&amp;nbsp; myname is Kellie Bedford. you can see some of my pics there, it was truly amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858075,"PostDate":1404397346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>my weddin at sandals whitehouse has now come and gone and it was t ruly amazing. if any of you ladies have facebook, please request me as a friend.\u00a0 myname is Kellie Bedford. you can see some of my pics there, it was truly amazing.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shugapop12@aol.com","IpAddress":"66.87.100.226","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1369916825,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shugapop1","Id":270119,"Name":"shugapop1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22e87569c6adcb38dca53cb311d0b578","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sandals resorts amazing!&amp;nbsp; I am sure your wedding was truly amazing.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I see a lot of great resorts listed, and have had a chance to visit several.&amp;nbsp; I would like to&amp;nbsp;visit Royalton based on what I have heard.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Another nice resort for weddings (18+) is Jewel at Dunn&#039;s River in Ocho Rios.&amp;nbsp; It is a small resort, formerly a Sandals, and worth taking a look at, if you are looking for a quaint spot.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858302,"PostDate":1404583440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sandals resorts amazing!\u00a0 I am sure your wedding was truly amazing.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see a lot of great resorts listed, and have had a chance to visit several.\u00a0 I would like to\u00a0visit Royalton based on what I have heard.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Another nice resort for weddings (18+) is Jewel at Dunn's River in Ocho Rios.\u00a0 It is a small resort, formerly a Sandals, and worth taking a look at, if you are looking for a quaint spot.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"boomer_396@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"67.193.91.193","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404246953,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Brinley","Id":278775,"Name":"Brinley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.233.118.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a2e5b1966150a7d7fa639f7bf5de11b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hello,&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;I&#039;m looking to see if anyone is getting married between Feb 25th and Mar 4th 2015 in Jamaica?.. Our wedding date is on Sat Feb 28th at the Riu in Negril. We have booked our amazing photographer Jamie Dimitry. His work is incredible and he is always down south doing weddings and has the experience. We were at a wedding in DR in April and he did the wedding and the results were just amazing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;What I am looking for is to see if anyone will be in Jamaica getting married at this time and looking for a reliable, experienced and super friendly photographer and see if we could split the cost of his travel because currently we are paying for a 3 day for him to come to our wedding.. But if anyone is interested in having him also we could extend his stay and split the costs of his travel as you know this is an extra costly cost.&lt;\/span&gt;\n\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Please don&#039;t hesitate to get back to me with any questions whatsoever.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858463,"PostDate":1404762360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Hello,<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">I'm looking to see if anyone is getting married between Feb 25th and Mar 4th 2015 in Jamaica?.. Our wedding date is on Sat Feb 28th at the Riu in Negril. We have booked our amazing photographer Jamie Dimitry. His work is incredible and he is always down south doing weddings and has the experience. We were at a wedding in DR in April and he did the wedding and the results were just amazing.\u00a0<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">What I am looking for is to see if anyone will be in Jamaica getting married at this time and looking for a reliable, experienced and super friendly photographer and see if we could split the cost of his travel because currently we are paying for a 3 day for him to come to our wedding.. But if anyone is interested in having him also we could extend his stay and split the costs of his travel as you know this is an extra costly cost.<\/span><br><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Please don't hesitate to get back to me with any questions whatsoever.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"virginiamadarasz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.233.118.189","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404750675,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Virginia","Id":278869,"Name":"Virginia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2cf431fa3ca27a93368e06f94ef6cd74","RawContent":"&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277379-futuremrsmichaud\/\" title=\"\"&gt;FutureMrsMichaud&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;\/span&gt;\n\n\t&lt;span&gt;How were the hairstylists at the Zentropia spa at Grand Palladium? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m getting married there in March and am a little nervous about the hair and makeup.&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863958,"PostDate":1406916265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277379-futuremrsmichaud\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>FutureMrsMichaud<\/a>, <\/span>\n\n\t<span>How were the hairstylists at the Zentropia spa at Grand Palladium? \u00a0I'm getting married there in March and am a little nervous about the hair and makeup.<\/span>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406915296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2fe0936828c7d586818ad3428338698","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Deanine\" post=\"1863958\" timestamp=\"1406916265\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277379-futuremrsmichaud\/\"]FutureMrsMichaud[\/url], How were the hairstylists at the Zentropia spa at Grand Palladium?  I&#039;m getting married there in March and am a little nervous about the hair and makeup.[\/quote]\nSending you a private message :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1863971,"PostDate":1406917726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Deanine, on 01 August 2014 - 10:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277379-futuremrsmichaud\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>FutureMrsMichaud<\/a>, How were the hairstylists at the Zentropia spa at Grand Palladium? \u00a0I'm getting married there in March and am a little nervous about the hair and makeup.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sending you a private message <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"eagommer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.66.34.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396030731,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277379.jpg?_r=1397626633","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsMichaud","Id":277379,"Name":"FutureMrsMichaud","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"beb31996d5f9541acd779803cb2bc5af","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsMichaud\" post=\"1863971\" timestamp=\"1406917726\"]\nSending you a private message :)[\/quote]Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1863980,"PostDate":1406918421,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsMichaud, on 01 August 2014 - 10:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Sending you a private message <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406915296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.79.206.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fae7f84fb8e0e830eab465f6d4b42f4c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Please email mysticindia2009@[member=\"gmail\"].com for quotations on Indian wedding planning, Delicious indian food, Priest Mandap Indian DJ etc.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867529,"PostDate":1408394444,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Please email mysticindia2009@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com for quotations on Indian wedding planning, Delicious indian food, Priest Mandap Indian DJ etc.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mysticindia2009@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.79.206.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408393046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279473.jpeg?_r=1408393492","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":183,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mystciindia","Id":279473,"Name":"Mystciindia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52b57eb2ca45cf03570dbdb47f4ecb2e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re getting married March 6th, 2015, at the Grand Palladium. &amp;nbsp;Does anyone have any information on local bands we can hire? &amp;nbsp;Looking for a Reggae band with a lead singer. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Deanine&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867612,"PostDate":1408451460,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!<\/p>\n<p>We're getting married March 6th, 2015, at the Grand Palladium. \u00a0Does anyone have any information on local bands we can hire? \u00a0Looking for a Reggae band with a lead singer. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!!<\/p>\n<p>Deanine<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deanine.sinisgalli@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"64.47.222.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406915296,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deanine","Id":279251,"Name":"Deanine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.137.210.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"721dbb8b1fa1cf9cb3a150581fb8f424","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so excited that I found this forum!!! I am getting married at the Gran Bahia Principe in November 2015! I&#039;m just getting started with the planning, so any advice is greatly appreciated :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks\n\nLeanne&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1867798,"PostDate":1408536291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so excited that I found this forum!!! I am getting married at the Gran Bahia Principe in November 2015! I'm just getting started with the planning, so any advice is greatly appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<br>\nLeanne<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leannebb@live.ca","IpAddress":"24.137.210.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1408535729,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"leannenl","Id":279494,"Name":"leannenl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.188.120.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a042a1522eb655a6a7c4a4421a057cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I will be having my wedding at the Holiday Inn Sunspreee in MBJ. I have been to several MBJ resorts and i have had the most fun here, it will be economical for my guests and i overrall love the service they provide. Wherever you choose in Jamaica, it will be beautiful. So far we are at about $4000 which is pretty good for what i want. I am sure we will be a bit higher but i know i woul dhave spent much more at home. I looked at doing it at the RIU, but they are a megaresort and i want the quaint feeling. I love that midway through my vacations with the HI, I have met several guests and pretty much recognized most of the people because not as many rooms. I looked at outside vendors but it is about the same as using the resort so i am just going to leave it in Julianne&#039;s hand (our onsite coordinator). I am looking for a place to deliver fried chicken, lol. They dont serve that on the resort and it is a must for my reception. Happy planning and if i can be of any assistance let me know.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868256,"PostDate":1408730847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I will be having my wedding at the Holiday Inn Sunspreee in MBJ. I have been to several MBJ resorts and i have had the most fun here, it will be economical for my guests and i overrall love the service they provide. Wherever you choose in Jamaica, it will be beautiful. So far we are at about $4000 which is pretty good for what i want. I am sure we will be a bit higher but i know i woul dhave spent much more at home. I looked at doing it at the RIU, but they are a megaresort and i want the quaint feeling. I love that midway through my vacations with the HI, I have met several guests and pretty much recognized most of the people because not as many rooms. I looked at outside vendors but it is about the same as using the resort so i am just going to leave it in Julianne's hand (our onsite coordinator). I am looking for a place to deliver fried chicken, lol. They dont serve that on the resort and it is a must for my reception. Happy planning and if i can be of any assistance let me know.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cankem80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.253.50.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407537957,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279372.png?_r=1436816059","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":209,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cankem80","Id":279372,"Name":"cankem80","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":134,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":70,"NextPage":80,"PreviousPage":60,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
