Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.184.220.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ee377b9c2555b9bbfbef4e47843ca54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our wedding date is April 2, 2015 at the Riu Montego Bay. This forum is so helpful, so much useful information! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870028,"PostDate":1409589488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our wedding date is April 2, 2015 at the Riu Montego Bay. This forum is so helpful, so much useful information! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"psetiloane@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.184.220.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1409441054,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"DK11","Id":279633,"Name":"DK11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"71a05a508b67731e68bfc4441b6c42dc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Tatimrivera\" post=\"1857511\" timestamp=\"1404097260\"]\nHi Francine. I also am from NJ but not a 2015 bride. I am getting married this upcoming October in IBRHS because we have children attending the wedding. Just to help you with some of your questions: our wedding budget is $14,000 and that&#039;s including ceremony and reception at the resort. I have included extras for our wedding like a welcome cocktail gathering the Wednesday before the wedding and we also have decorations of our own and we splurged on the favors (we are doing t-shirts).\nThis forum has helped a lot with location reviews and awesome ideas.[\/quote]\nThank you for your response!! @[member=\"tatimrivera\"] That sounds great. Your wedding day is going to be awesome.  My fiance and I decided to go with a villa in Ocho RIos with the ocean in the backdrop. It is beautiful. So far our budget is close to $9000 and includes almost everything (DJ, cocktail hour, food, wedding planner, decor, alcohol, photography\/videography, etc) We have to decide on wedding favors and some other minor stuff. I know you must be excited to get married next month!! Wish you all the best and maybe you could share some pics when you get back. Congrats!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1871009,"PostDate":1410194114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Tatimrivera, on 29 June 2014 - 07:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Francine. I also am from NJ but not a 2015 bride. I am getting married this upcoming October in IBRHS because we have children attending the wedding. Just to help you with some of your questions: our wedding budget is $14,000 and that's including ceremony and reception at the resort. I have included extras for our wedding like a welcome cocktail gathering the Wednesday before the wedding and we also have decorations of our own and we splurged on the favors (we are doing t-shirts).<br>\nThis forum has helped a lot with location reviews and awesome ideas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you for your response!! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278701\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/278701-tatimrivera\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Tatimrivera<\/span><\/a> That sounds great. Your wedding day is going to be awesome. \u00a0My fiance and I decided to go with a villa in Ocho RIos with the ocean in the backdrop. It is beautiful. So far our budget is close to $9000 and includes almost everything (DJ, cocktail hour, food, wedding planner, decor, alcohol, photography\/videography, etc) We have to decide on wedding favors and some other minor stuff. I know you must be excited to get married next month!! Wish you all the best and maybe you could share some pics when you get back. Congrats!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brahamf@student.wpunj.edu","IpAddress":"173.251.113.202","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385514427,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275352.jpg?_r=1437768881","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Francine Braham","Id":275352,"Name":"Francine Braham","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.188.120.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d0450f0b0e37d084ee2793aadebd6eb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello all, my name is Candice and I will be getting married on June 22, 2015 at the Holiday Inn Sunspree in MoBay. We chose this resort becuase it is economical for out guest and we have stayed here several times. Our kids absolutely love it. We are having a hard time chosing what to bring ourselves and what to have done there as the prices are so expensive. My mother can make alot of the decorations but its the hassle of bringing it. Can you all recommend any good and reasonable wedding planners. We have had some absolutely ridiculous quotes. I am looking for room lighting, table decorations, and&amp;nbsp;backdrop (drapery). Francine for my OOT bags&amp;nbsp;I am doing what i call survival kits with practical things. I am doing 2, one for the way there and&amp;nbsp;one while there are there. The first has luggage tags that i had made, games for the plane, ear buds, gum, tylenol, etc. The 2nd has suncreen, pepto,&amp;nbsp;room key holder, playing cards, little stuff like that. I think i may do sand in a bottle for them to take home as a momento. I like the jerk sauce idea.&amp;nbsp;It was really nice meeting everyone. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873380,"PostDate":1411740190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all, my name is Candice and I will be getting married on June 22, 2015 at the Holiday Inn Sunspree in MoBay. We chose this resort becuase it is economical for out guest and we have stayed here several times. Our kids absolutely love it. We are having a hard time chosing what to bring ourselves and what to have done there as the prices are so expensive. My mother can make alot of the decorations but its the hassle of bringing it. Can you all recommend any good and reasonable wedding planners. We have had some absolutely ridiculous quotes. I am looking for room lighting, table decorations, and\u00a0backdrop (drapery). Francine for my OOT bags\u00a0I am doing what i call survival kits with practical things. I am doing 2, one for the way there and\u00a0one while there are there. The first has luggage tags that i had made, games for the plane, ear buds, gum, tylenol, etc. The 2nd has suncreen, pepto,\u00a0room key holder, playing cards, little stuff like that. I think i may do sand in a bottle for them to take home as a momento. I like the jerk sauce idea.\u00a0It was really nice meeting everyone. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cankem80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.253.50.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407537957,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279372.png?_r=1436816059","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":209,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cankem80","Id":279372,"Name":"cankem80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.223.75.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfe5d8e4d04b9d3f188b1e368e08cb09","RawContent":"We were married in Jamaica this past April. We stayed at the Iberostar in Montego Bay. Great Place! They only have 1 wedding per day which makes it that much more special. We hired Elite Media Concepts for videography and DJ services and they were awesome! The wedding coordinators at the resort are awesome! You can go onto the Elite Media Concepts site and see our Highlights video Brigitte and Marcel More Than Words Can Say.\n&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/.\"&gt;http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/.&lt;\/a&gt; Here is the direct link to our video.\n\n\n\nBrigitte Gravelle\n\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1874038,"PostDate":1412263109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We were married in Jamaica this past April. We stayed at the Iberostar in Montego Bay. Great Place! They only have 1 wedding per day which makes it that much more special. We hired Elite Media Concepts for videography and DJ services and they were awesome! The wedding coordinators at the resort are awesome! You can go onto the Elite Media Concepts site and see our Highlights video Brigitte and Marcel More Than Words Can Say.<br \/><a href='http:\/\/elitemediaconcepts.com\/brigitte-marcel-more-than-words-can-say\/.' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/elitemediacon...words-can-say\/.<\/a> Here is the direct link to our video.<br><br><br>\nBrigitte Gravelle<br>\nSent from my iPad using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brigbest@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.223.75.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357876018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264253.jpg?_r=1412263677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brigitte","Id":264253,"Name":"Brigitte","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.46.107.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c688d26fc45914e80204491bc5eaaeff","RawContent":"Hi everyone! \n\nI&#039;m wondering if anyone can help me..I have been in contact with Diana Campbell from digital memories photography and just wondered if any if you have chosen them or know anyone who has? I&#039;ve spoken to my travel agent about sending a deposit but they advised me to check it out first and make sure they are a reputable company. Any advice is very much appreciated. Thankyou\n\nKatie x","Attachments":[],"Id":1877137,"PostDate":1414517274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone! <br>\nI'm wondering if anyone can help me..I have been in contact with Diana Campbell from digital memories photography and just wondered if any if you have chosen them or know anyone who has? I've spoken to my travel agent about sending a deposit but they advised me to check it out first and make sure they are a reputable company. Any advice is very much appreciated. Thankyou<br>\nKatie x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"loopykatz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"82.46.10.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381270370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274100.jpg?_r=1406583827","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"katieals","Id":274100,"Name":"katieals","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.254.6.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ece9f88da00cc7401fee3862e945b8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Finally have our wedding booked at Firefly for March 14, 2015!!! It has taken 5 and a half months to get everything in order and booked!!! So relieved that this part is finally done but since we took so long to set the location, I only have 19 weeks to work out all of the other little details!!! Yikes!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1877367,"PostDate":1414684524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Finally have our wedding booked at Firefly for March 14, 2015!!! It has taken 5 and a half months to get everything in order and booked!!! So relieved that this part is finally done but since we took so long to set the location, I only have 19 weeks to work out all of the other little details!!! Yikes!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redwoodwedding15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"209.254.6.82","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404315682,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ftrmrsredwood","Id":278791,"Name":"ftrmrsredwood","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.206.232.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5155a8e994a61d437938d3c9ec236748","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am Pam and I&#039;m actually inquiring for my niece. &amp;nbsp;She&#039;s getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please chime in. &amp;nbsp;Time&#039;s going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881226,"PostDate":1419874443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am Pam and I'm actually inquiring for my niece. \u00a0She's getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please chime in. \u00a0Time's going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pamela.reece730@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.206.232.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419873551,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"preece","Id":281510,"Name":"preece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b24a98ba0478711fe4d5e1b773826f82","RawContent":"[quote name=\"preece\" post=\"1881226\" timestamp=\"1419874443\"]\nHello everyone.\n\nI am Pam and I&#039;m actually inquiring for my niece.  She&#039;s getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.\n\nWe need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.\n\nPlease chime in.  Time&#039;s going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.\n\nThanks so much!!![\/quote]Contact wright travel- they own this site. They work with Americans on several different packages and can help with room blocks. Tell your niece to join here with fellow brides for the planning fun.. This forum is incredibly helpful in that regard.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881229,"PostDate":1419874883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>preece, on 29 December 2014 - 09:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hello everyone.<br><br>\nI am Pam and I'm actually inquiring for my niece.  She's getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.<br><br>\nWe need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.<br><br>\nPlease chime in.  Time's going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.<br><br>\nThanks so much!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nContact wright travel- they own this site. They work with Americans on several different packages and can help with room blocks. Tell your niece to join here with fellow brides for the planning fun.. This forum is incredibly helpful in that regard.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.167.5.214","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a14a565152438de06922f6ff2d34ca3","RawContent":"Your niece&#039;s wedding is the day after mine (in Montego Bay)! Definitely work with a travel agent on the room reservations, but other brides on this site can answer other questions! There are a ton of good ideas on the forums, even in threads for other resorts and locations. \n[quote name=\"preece\" post=\"1881226\" timestamp=\"1419874443\"]\nHello everyone.\n\nI am Pam and I&#039;m actually inquiring for my niece.  She&#039;s getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.\n\nWe need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.\n\nPlease chime in.  Time&#039;s going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.\n\nThanks so much!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1881247,"PostDate":1419882759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your niece's wedding is the day after mine (in Montego Bay)! Definitely work with a travel agent on the room reservations, but other brides on this site can answer other questions! There are a ton of good ideas on the forums, even in threads for other resorts and locations.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>preece, on 29 December 2014 - 09:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello everyone.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am Pam and I'm actually inquiring for my niece. \u00a0She's getting married June 12, 2015; a destination wedding at The Rui in Ocho Rios Jamaica.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We need someone from BDW to just help us with coordination; blocking rooms etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please chime in. \u00a0Time's going so fast and my niece is stressed out big time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.188.106.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea75ab13999159e1f61a54dd6633603f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would also def suggest going with a travel agent. I am a travel agent and I wish I would have gone with an outside agent instead of doing it on my own. If you go to the RIU website they have all of their wedding packages. Check out this link&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.riu.com\/en\/weddings\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.riu.com\/en\/weddings\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;\\&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;and you can actually put in the wedding date to make sure it is available. They have 4 packages you can choose from and you can customize from there. I actually considered the Riu but decided to go with the location my children wanted. Once you put in your email address on the website they will contact you and walk you through the process. If you need anymore help please let me know.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881250,"PostDate":1419883545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would also def suggest going with a travel agent. I am a travel agent and I wish I would have gone with an outside agent instead of doing it on my own. If you go to the RIU website they have all of their wedding packages. Check out this link<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.riu.com\/en\/weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.riu.com\/en\/weddings\/<\/a>\u00a0\\<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>and you can actually put in the wedding date to make sure it is available. They have 4 packages you can choose from and you can customize from there. I actually considered the Riu but decided to go with the location my children wanted. Once you put in your email address on the website they will contact you and walk you through the process. If you need anymore help please let me know.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cankem80@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.253.50.168","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407537957,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279372.png?_r=1436816059","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":209,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cankem80","Id":279372,"Name":"cankem80","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":134,"TotalPages":14,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":130},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
