<strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137209820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79181,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b43e152a820aed003424b93ce705d35","RawContent":"Ohh yes and I&#039;ve sent her a tonne of referrals :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1896205,"PostDate":1431544513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ohh yes and I've sent her a tonne of referrals <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79181,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51acea010912c8c9e1b4424596360848","RawContent":"[quote name=\"smileitseb\" post=\"1896113\" timestamp=\"1431520967\"]\nShould I tip our travel agent? I am not sure what other destination wedding brides do? And if so, what did you tip her? Money or send flowers, etc?[\/quote]\nI have sent her a few referrals. She actually hand delivered to my work a beautiful basket to me for referring a few brides to her. When we get back, I plan on sending her a flower arrangement or an edible arrangement. She really has gone above and beyond for us. Our guests have nothing but great things to say about her.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896335,"PostDate":1431620383,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>smileitseb, on 13 May 2015 - 08:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Should I tip our travel agent? I am not sure what other destination wedding brides do? And if so, what did you tip her? Money or send flowers, etc?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have sent her a few referrals. She actually hand delivered to my\u00a0work\u00a0a beautiful basket to me for referring a few brides to her. When\u00a0we get back, I plan on sending her\u00a0a flower arrangement or an edible arrangement. She really has gone above and beyond for us. Our guests have nothing but great things to say about her.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426158386,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79181","Title":"Tip Travel Agent?","LastPostDate":1431620383},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
