> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78950,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"52be5c2951a82e2899a3364db9eb5614","RawContent":"I only did invites, that said.... I had a friend tell me to my face she couldn&#039;t come and to take lots of pictures for her.   So with that said I didn&#039;t send her an invite.  One day I was sending her some pictures of wedding stuff I was working on and I got &#039;would have been nice to be invited&#039; I explained my side and she never responded so NEXT. Don&#039;t need the drama. \n\n\nSo while I think I&#039;d still skip over no&#039;s after that incident maybe it&#039;s just safer to send them to everyone. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890128,"PostDate":1426800067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I only did invites, that said.... I had a friend tell me to my face she couldn't come and to take lots of pictures for her.   So with that said I didn't send her an invite.  One day I was sending her some pictures of wedding stuff I was working on and I got 'would have been nice to be invited' I explained my side and she never responded so NEXT. Don't need the drama. <br><br>\nSo while I think I'd still skip over no's after that incident maybe it's just safer to send them to everyone. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"153.31.112.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78950,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"04ec0cc2acf72c4a66ffd8026ad32afe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks Ladies.   I never thought of it that some people might be even waiting for an invitation. I will consider to send out more, but some people I won&#039;t bother.&amp;nbsp; And for those who will be offended after expressing you WOULDN&#039;T be&amp;nbsp; attendin, I will just help them out by giving them a reason to start drama as they always do...... :rolleyes:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And the Email save the dates were sent through Destinationweddings.com, which is who I&#039;ve booked my travel and wedding through. They directed the guests to the page with my travel arrangements and provided&amp;nbsp; payment info and the TA contact info.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890147,"PostDate":1426833683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks Ladies.\u00a0\u00a0 I never thought of it that some people might be even waiting for an invitation. I will consider to send out more, but some people I won't bother.\u00a0 And for those who will be offended after expressing you WOULDN'T be\u00a0 attendin, I will just help them out by giving them a reason to start drama as they always do...... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And the Email save the dates were sent through Destinationweddings.com, which is who I've booked my travel and wedding through. They directed the guests to the page with my travel arrangements and provided\u00a0 payment info and the TA contact info.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"soon2bmzbrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.82.62","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423498300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Soon2bmzbrooks","Id":282051,"Name":"Soon2bmzbrooks","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.119.104.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78950,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f9ef647bf6b2b3a79f8dddf080d2ab8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Soon2bmzbrooks\"] We sent out invitations to everyone who received a Save the Date, just in case!! Any chance to avoid drama, we took it&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp; And we got no&#039;s from a few people who had said they were definitely coming, and a few surprise yes&#039;s from people who said they were not coming!&amp;nbsp;You never know.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck with your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890185,"PostDate":1426858541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282051\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282051-soon2bmzbrooks\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Soon2bmzbrooks<\/span><\/a> We sent out invitations to everyone who received a Save the Date, just in case!! Any chance to avoid drama, we took it\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 And we got no's from a few people who had said they were definitely coming, and a few surprise yes's from people who said they were not coming!\u00a0You never know.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of luck with your planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgugenheim@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.121.31.46","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1391789727,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276557.jpg?_r=1433950078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Soon2beMrsJ","Id":276557,"Name":"Soon2beMrsJ","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
