{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":96778,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that racht33 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79315-guest-list-spreadsheet-template\/?view=findpost&p=1899216\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"Ao1070\" the weddingwire website had been super helpful !! I created a site with all the travel information, resort info etc and filled in the names and plus ones for everyone we sent a Save the date to. The save the dates had the website information and we asked everyone to RSVP through. People have been able to locate their name and RSVP right through the site. It even sends you an alert instantly who has RSVP and if they signed the guestbook.\n \nOne thing that really helps is if many of your guest are tech savy. The site can be accessed by smart phone, pc and tablet. But if you rather go your own route they have templates on the site you can play around with. I hope that helps.<img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1435150792,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"1","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
