itReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a7ebb2160e3bbb30f7a4e2774ba3aad","RawContent":"It looks really nice! You did a great job on them.","Attachments":[],"Id":327185,"PostDate":1212547429,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It looks really nice! You did a great job on them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Maida & Tomas<\/span><br><span>Circa 2004 - Our first picture together!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"msharpe77@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1202541925,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208514.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Myda77","Id":208514,"Name":"Myda77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca45698ca1b2317e394c24350f9998d5","RawContent":"Very nice, you did a great job!","Attachments":[],"Id":327241,"PostDate":1212550449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Very nice, you did a great job!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>June 01, 2009, Nassau Bahamas<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/community.theknot.com\/cs\/ks\/user\/page.aspx?username=sumrdream\">My Planning Bio<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"eshier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1209419785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209220.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sumrdream","Id":209220,"Name":"sumrdream","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eea82d06d1c9ead2192d2430a063652b","RawContent":"I printed the inside pages on a color laser printer and the outside cover on an inkjet. I tried three color lasers and none would work with the shiny slick blue paper. So I had to buy an inkjet that had paper that loaded from the top and came down. My inkjet pulls from the front and turns and comes out the front. That doesn&#039;t work with most cardstock because it is too thick to make the turn. Then I just used blue staples to keep them together.\n \n Minde","Attachments":[],"Id":327563,"PostDate":1212587854,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I printed the inside pages on a color laser printer and the outside cover on an inkjet. I tried three color lasers and none would work with the shiny slick blue paper. So I had to buy an inkjet that had paper that loaded from the top and came down. My inkjet pulls from the front and turns and comes out the front. That doesn't work with most cardstock because it is too thick to make the turn. Then I just used blue staples to keep them together.<br \/> <br \/> Minde\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20081005\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-1\/k\/f0c4\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f0c4\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"minde_johnsen@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1203264665,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208567.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Minde","Id":208567,"Name":"Minde","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":15009,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"385cddaa4ee2785a885f273d84c6dc15","RawContent":"awesome job girl!!!!\n \n Your skills are amazing. \n \n I am so impressed!","Attachments":[],"Id":327570,"PostD