happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx","Attachments":[],"Id":691439,"PostDate":1242325942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                oh i cant wait i had posted on here that this was the dress i was looking for cos its just so different and like yourself i felt it would make a perfect trash the dress.I wanted to know who the designer was and they were a little secretive so i didnt get to find out and was worried just in case it wasnt as pretty as it looks in the photos.Im glad you are happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roo6637@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1208337577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"roo66","Id":209110,"Name":"roo66","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34441933ab06138a7cb46258c58d1753","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;roo66&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;oh i cant wait i had posted on here that this was the dress i was looking for cos its just so different and like yourself i felt it would make a perfect trash the dress.I wanted to know who the designer was and they were a little secretive so i didnt get to find out and was worried just in case it wasnt as pretty as it looks in the photos.Im glad you are happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Im having problems adding the photos on the forum so if you want to PM me your email I can send them to you.","Attachments":[],"Id":691777,"PostDate":1242341869,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>roo66<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">oh i cant wait i had posted on here that this was the dress i was looking for cos its just so different and like yourself i felt it would make a perfect trash the dress.I wanted to know who the designer was and they were a little secretive so i didnt get to find out and was worried just in case it wasnt as pretty as it looks in the photos.Im glad you are happy with the purchase please hurry and post piccies sooooooooooooonnn thanks a milion maria xx<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Im having problems adding the photos on the forum so if you want to PM me your email I can send them to you.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dawsar83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233591039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214537.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":57,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dee83","Id":214537,"Name":"Dee83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a7e27d6f550779f4cafe08585362a9d","RawContent":"Do you have a photobucket account? If not we have one for forum use. You just upload your photo on photobucket resize it to medium or small and then when you hover over the pic in your album it will drop down a window and you select and copy the last code, starting with [img]. Then paste it in your post! I really want to see it. I&#039;ve been curious about it since roo posted a thread looking for the designer.","Attachments":[],"Id":691812,"PostDate":1242343835,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do you have a photobucket account? If not we have one for forum use. You just upload your photo on photobucket resize it to medium or small and then when you hover over the pic in your album it will drop down a window and you select and copy the last code, starting with [img]. Then paste it in your post! I really want to see it. I've been curious about it since roo posted a thread looking for the designer.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212460200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2ce4bacb2eeb96e6b6ee013b8511952","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Jacilynda&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn&#039;t find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn&#039;t have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn&#039;t see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy&#039;s prices\n \n Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;With regards to Duosheng - a few people I know have ordered from them and they were really happy. I ordered a formal dress last week (I have an event to go to) and it cost US150 for the dress and postage ($200 australian) which is really great. It is meant to arrive at the end of the month so I will let you know when it arrives. As far as payment goes - they use paypal so thats what I went with. \n \n &amp;quot;down here&amp;quot; in Australia a Maggie Sottero dress starts at around $1800 AUD 0r about USD$1370 so expensive. I have no problems going online to save myself money.","Attachments":[],"Id":691858,"PostDate":1242345428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Jacilynda<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Have you heard any reviews on them? I tried searching for reviews on them and didn't find any which is fishy to me. Also credible pages always have their accepted forms of payment listed in a small logo on the bottom of their pages and they didn't have this listed. Did you contact them regarding seeing a pic of the dress before being sent? I didn't see anywhere on their page where it said they did that. What are their prices? I found another forum that was talking about them but no one had ordered from them there prices were quite high, at least double landy's prices<br \/> <br \/> Sorry for all the questions. Alot of girls come to this thread looking for someone good and credible to do their dress and these are things to be addressed.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>With regards to Duosheng - a few people I know have ordered from them and they were really happy. I ordered a formal dress last week (I have an event to go to) and it cost US150 for the dress and postage ($200 australian) which is really great. It is meant to arrive at the end of the month so I will let you know when it arrives. As far as payment goes - they use paypal so thats what I went with. <br \/> <br \/> \"down here\" in Australia a Maggie Sottero dress starts at around $1800 AUD 0r about USD$1370 so expensive. I have no problems going online to save myself money.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/150\/20100227\/We+Get+Married\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/2142\/...ied\/ticker.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"joeymosis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233646244,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214576.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*tanga*","Id":214576,"Name":"*tanga*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6548a833cbf5de793ade11c6d338919f","RawContent":"Thanks Jacilynda for letting me know how to post pictures. So here they are:\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n You cant tell from the pictures, but there is soooooo much tulle under the skirt to give it the poofy look...\n And for comparisons sake this is the picture on the website :\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/ttd.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":692015,"PostDate":1242353475,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Jacilynda for letting me know how to post pictures. So here they are:<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/003.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/004.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/002.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> You cant tell from the pictures, but there is soooooo much tulle under the skirt to give it the poofy look...<br \/> And for comparisons sake this is the picture on the website :<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i725.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww255\/Dawsar_2009\/ttd.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/NRjNm3\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"dawsar83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1233591039,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214537.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":57,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dee83","Id":214537,"Name":"Dee83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"596ef008cf168906f01e88b931f529d0","RawContent":"from a photographers stand point with all things these days.... be it fake dresses, jewerly, sunglasses, AND personalities (jk) you can&#039;t really tell too much of a difference. \n \n I&#039;m sure the quality and materials will be a bit less quality but when all is said and done who is really gonna know in the end. \n \n besides you buy it and even if it sucks you aren&#039;t out much money and could sell it on ebay and get the real deal..\n \n i always say SAVE WHERE YOU CAN :) (except photographers cough cough) hahaha\n \n :)","Attachments":[],"Id":692034,"PostDate":1242354308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                from a photographers stand point with all things these days.... be it fake dresses, jewerly, sunglasses, AND personalities (jk) you can't really tell too much of a difference. <br \/> <br \/> I'm sure the quality and materials will be a bit less quality but when all is said and done who is really gonna know in the end. <br \/> <br \/> besides you buy it and even if it sucks you aren't out much money and could sell it on ebay and get the real deal..<br \/> <br \/> i always say SAVE WHERE YOU CAN <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> (except photographers cough cough) hahaha<br \/> <br \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jean-marcus@jean-marcus.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1190143380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207758.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jean-marcus","Id":207758,"Name":"jean-marcus","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e196376e64609e34fc9546847ae1cfd","RawContent":"LOL we&#039;ve missed you jean-marcus!\n \n Dee I really like this! I first saw it when roo posted about the designer and wasnt to sure about it. But I really like it! The colors are alot brighter than I thought! \n \n Roo i say get it! I think you can rock this dress at 40!","Attachments":[],"Id":692230,"PostDate":1242364599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                LOL we've missed you jean-marcus!<br \/> <br \/> Dee I really like this! I first saw it when roo posted about the designer and wasnt to sure about it. But I really like it! The colors are alot brighter than I thought! <br \/> <br \/> Roo i say get it! I think you can rock this dress at 40!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>