{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cb7d4da4a6ba522f5c9d8e1e16a297d","RawContent":"I love this dress...but I&#039;m not sure its in the budget :) I guess we&#039;ll see....\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i69.photobucket.com\/albums\/i77\/jendugan62\/HALLIELONGSIT_f.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":30060,"PostDate":1172502716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love this dress...but I'm not sure its in the budget <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I guess we'll see....<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i69.photobucket.com\/albums\/i77\/jendugan62\/HALLIELONGSIT_f.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jendugan62@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1167885840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207014.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jen","Id":207014,"Name":"Jen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f50afb3de29d8115a0d026c1750bb10","RawContent":"Christa again I love your dress! \n \n Alright Girls, This is the best picture I could find that almost looks like my dress. Here are differences! \n 1- where everything pulls together to one side there is a broach.\n 2-there is no where near that much fabric in the back of the dress\n 3-it actually comes up a little bit higher in the middle of the top. It&#039;s more rounded than straight across! \n \n But for the most part it really does look almost like my dress! \n Now the picture isn&#039;t great because I tore it out of a magazine and scanned it! \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i116.photobucket.com\/albums\/o4\/gnat1711\/00000001.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":31268,"PostDate":1172798675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Christa again I love your dress! <br \/> <br \/> Alright Girls, This is the best picture I could find that almost looks like my dress. Here are differences! <br \/> 1- where everything pulls together to one side there is a broach.<br \/> 2-there is no where near that much fabric in the back of the dress<br \/> 3-it actually comes up a little bit higher in the middle of the top. It's more rounded than straight across! <br \/> <br \/> But for the most part it really does look almost like my dress! <br \/> Now the picture isn't great because I tore it out of a magazine and scanned it! <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i116.photobucket.com\/albums\/o4\/gnat1711\/00000001.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gnat1711@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1160497500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206849.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":73,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Natalie Z","Id":206849,"Name":"Natalie Z","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91d7ae7ce395bae535fa99d83f54af93","RawContent":"So Jessalyn, I just could NOT resist, and went to try on your dress, and I LOVED IT!\n \n BUT, I wanted to know because I was trying dresses on, and I felt fine, and when I put yours on, suddenly I was BOILING hot. And, the fabric is really thick. Are you worried at all about being too hot? Or just not worrying about it because the dress is so gorgeous? Or did you somehow take the thick hot layer out? Just wondering!\n \n And Tammy - no, not allowed pictures, but these are the ones I liked best (the top one being Jessalyn&#039;s, I hope this doesn&#039;t make you mad, like I&#039;m copying you!). \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.casablancabridal.com\/Products\/Detail.asp?ModelNo=1831&amp;amp;Cat=Fall+Collection&amp;amp;SubCat=2006\"&gt;CasaBlancaBridal.com: Fall Collection\/1831&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.casablancabridal.com\/Products\/Detail.asp?View=F&amp;amp;ModelNo=1772&amp;amp;Cat=Spring%20Collection&amp;amp;SubCat=2005\"&gt;CasaBlancaBridal.com: Spring Collection\/1772&lt;\/a&gt;\n For some reason, you have to copy and paste this one, the link doesn&#039;t work.","Attachments":[],"Id":32043,"PostDate":1173080649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So Jessalyn, I just could NOT resist, and went to try on your dress, and I LOVED IT!<br \/> <br \/> BUT, I wanted to know because I was trying dresses on, and I felt fine, and when I put yours on, suddenly I was BOILING hot. And, the fabric is really thick. Are you worried at all about being too hot? Or just not worrying about it because the dress is so gorgeous? Or did you somehow take the thick hot layer out? Just wondering!<br \/> <br \/> And Tammy - no, not allowed pictures, but these are the ones I liked best (the top one being Jessalyn's, I hope this doesn't make you mad, like I'm copying you!). <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.casablancabridal.com\/Products\/Detail.asp?ModelNo=1831&Cat=Fall+Collection&SubCat=2006' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>CasaBlancaBridal.com: Fall Collection\/1831<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.casablancabridal.com\/Products\/Detail.asp?View=F&ModelNo=1772&Cat=Spring%20Collection&SubCat=2005' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>CasaBlancaBridal.com: Spring Collection\/1772<\/a><br \/> For some reason, you have to copy and paste this one, the link doesn't work.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Margaret & Eric<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mhollendoner@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1167243660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206993.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MagsieMexico","Id":206993,"Name":"MagsieMexico","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53b8d4fdfd129593d27d103a40246d32","RawContent":"So I was checking out some of Sol Tamargo&#039;s since she just sent out an email about her recent awards w\/the WPJA (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.agwpja.com\/\"&gt;[AG]WPJA: Artistic Wedding Photojournalism : Fine Art Wedding Photography&lt;\/a&gt;). I noticed that one of the girls in a winning photo was wearing my dress! Why this is exciting, I don&#039;t know. But it is. So I asked her if I could see the whole wedding - and she sent me the link to the slide show. Here&#039;s my dress of a very beautiful bride! I just hope I can pull it off half as well as she did! She had a Christian and Hindu wedding, and she changes dresses at some point in the evening.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.soltamargo.com\/weddings\/michelle&amp;amp;vipul\/\"&gt;Sol Tamargo Photography Wedding Photojournalism&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34260,"PostDate":1173841458,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I was checking out some of Sol Tamargo's since she just sent out an email about her recent awards w\/the WPJA (<a href='http:\/\/www.agwpja.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>[AG]WPJA: Artistic Wedding Photojournalism : Fine Art Wedding Photography<\/a>). I noticed that one of the girls in a winning photo was wearing my dress! Why this is exciting, I don't know. But it is. So I asked her if I could see the whole wedding - and she sent me the link to the slide show. Here's my dress of a very beautiful bride! I just hope I can pull it off half as well as she did! She had a Christian and Hindu wedding, and she changes dresses at some point in the evening.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.soltamargo.com\/weddings\/michelle&vipul\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sol Tamargo Photography Wedding Photojournalism<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/anns-annr-las-caletas-dreams-pv-hawaii-review-looooooong-6068\/'>Ann's Caletas Wedding & Hawaii Honeymoon Review<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.leighmillerphotography.com\/darkroom\/share\/?n=ann_paul'>Our Caletas Wedding Slideshow (by Leigh Miller)<\/a><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.onetruemedia.com\/shared?p=31de360c85cec8376c35a5&skin_id=701&utm_source=otm&utm_medium=image'>Our Caletas Wedding Video<\/a>","Email":"annkherrick@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"76.16.7.43","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1161378480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206863.jpg?_r=1429384252","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LCBride2007","Id":206863,"Name":"LCBride2007","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f45ff27e7b35a99248028623669afda","RawContent":"ok nevermind....I think it&#039;s because it&#039;s from David&#039;s Bridal and they won&#039;t let you copy pick...but here is the website.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/bridal_gowns_detail.jsp?stid=1223&amp;amp;prodgroup=10\"&gt;http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/bridal_g...3&amp;amp;prodgroup=10&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34329,"PostDate":1173886774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                ok nevermind....I think it's because it's from David's Bridal and they won't let you copy pick...but here is the website.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/bridal_gowns_detail.jsp?stid=1223&prodgroup=10' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.davidsbri....3&prodgroup=10<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dreaw14369@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1140643200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206721.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DreaW","Id":206721,"Name":"DreaW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26c71de5302697909c64142bd017ec0a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;DREA14369&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;ok nevermind....I think it&#039;s because it&#039;s from David&#039;s Bridal and they won&#039;t let you copy pick...but here is the website.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_545f84b76847b2.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34386,"PostDate":1173900246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>DREA14369<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">ok nevermind....I think it's because it's from David's Bridal and they won't let you copy pick...but here is the website.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_545f84b76847b2.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kashmira & Dan<\/span><br><span>Happily married since June 16, 2007<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l139\/gkashmira\/IMG_0769.jpg\">http:\/\/i95.photobucket.com\/albums\/l1...a\/IMG_0769.jpg<\/a><br><span>Our mini-video: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html\">http:\/\/www.bajavideoproductions.com\/Kash_Dan.html<\/a><br><span>Photo slideshow: <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php\">http:\/\/www.tomasbarron.com\/recent.php<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"gkashmira@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1156793160,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206698.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":81,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gkashmira","Id":206698,"Name":"gkashmira","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f5865a732af5cedf0fc79303092b2f8","RawContent":"here&#039;s a link to mine. i&#039;m having buyers remorse :) i feel like its too dressy - is that silly? has anyone else regretted their decision? when i have it on i love it but when i think about it i feel like i should have gone more causal. \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.watters.com\/product.php?coll=brides&amp;amp;showid=422\"&gt;Watters Brides | Bridal Gown Collection | Style 7056B | Silk shantung strapless gown with pleated bodice, bustled back skirt and silk shantung flower. Available in floor length or extra length.&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":34821,"PostDate":1174056155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                here's a link to mine. i'm having buyers remorse <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> i feel like its too dressy - is that silly? has anyone else regretted their decision? when i have it on i love it but when i think about it i feel like i should have gone more causal. <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.watters.com\/product.php?coll=brides&showid=422' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Watters Brides | Bridal Gown Collection | Style 7056B | Silk shantung strapless gown with pleated bodice, bustled back skirt and silk shantung flower. Available in floor length or extra length.<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;0\/st\/20070505\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ebfd\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...ebfd\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sstarkey71@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1165805077,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206955.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akumalbound","Id":206955,"Name":"akumalbound","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8802f91fb29032e8eddf0850eff50019","RawContent":"So, while I am patiently awaiting the picture of my dress from China to see if it&#039;ll work so I can pick flowers, colors, etc, I am also shopping for a reception dress. Since my wedding is at 10:00 a.m., I want a different, way more casual dress (short) to wear to the reception.\n And while I haven&#039;t fallen in love with any dress I&#039;ve found so far (including the one I picked to wear to my wedding), I went shopping this weekend and TOTALLY fell in love with this Richmond dress I found. It is so crazy because it basically looks like a swimsuit coverup (gauzy tunic with plunging neckline and tie between the boobs) with lots of silver beads all over. It&#039;s so the opposite of what I was thinking, but I can&#039;t get my mind off of it. Of course it was $528, which is 3X what I&#039;m spending on my actual wedding dress and way exorbitant seeing as you can fold it up into the size of a handkerchief.\n Anyone else seen any similar dresses (with a dropped waist) at a more palatable price? Remember, I am FRUGAL BRIDE.\n Thanks!\n Laura\n P.S. This is similar:\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.fashionfm.it\/images\/gallery\/big\/559_John_Richmond_02102006174214.jpg\"&gt;http:\/\/www.fashionfm.it\/images\/galle...2006174214.jpg&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":35264,"PostDate":1174266416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So, while I am patiently awaiting the picture of my dress from China to see if it'll work so I can pick flowers, colors, etc, I am also shopping for a reception dress. Since my wedding is at 10:00 a.m., I want a different, way more casual dress (short) to wear to the reception.<br \/> And while I haven't fallen in love with any dress I've found so far (including the one I picked to wear to my wedding), I went shopping this weekend and TOTALLY fell in love with this Richmond dress I found. It is so crazy because it basically looks like a swimsuit coverup (gauzy tunic with plunging neckline and tie between the boobs) with lots of silver beads all over. It's so the opposite of what I was thinking, but I can't get my mind off of it. Of course it was $528, which is 3X what I'm spending on my actual wedding dress and way exorbitant seeing as you can fold it up into the size of a handkerchief.<br \/> Anyone else seen any similar dresses (with a dropped waist) at a more palatable price? Remember, I am FRUGAL BRIDE.<br \/> Thanks!<br \/> Laura<br \/> P.S. This is similar:<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.fashionfm.it\/images\/gallery\/big\/559_John_Richmond_02102006174214.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.fashionfm....2006174214.jpg<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i78.photobucket.com\/albums\/j83\/shaagensen\/tulum\/shellrings.jpg\">http:\/\/i78.photobucket.com\/albums\/j8...shellrings.jpg<\/a><br><span>Laura & Michael<\/span><br><span>07\/07\/07<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lauraabrooks@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1171007381,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207143.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"laura b","Id":207143,"Name":"laura b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"21e253e3d1341967899887e5efac8fb2","RawContent":"Here&#039;s THE dress.. I felt beautiful in it and didn&#039;t worry about it being too fancy because of the plain bottom in front and the bustle but I didn&#039;t order it because I wanted to see if I could find it cheaper (which I did). Anyhow I&#039;m 98% sure I&#039;m ordering this tomorrow. Do you think a lace up back would work? I&#039;m worried it will take away from the back, but I like how they make a dress feel secure.\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828front.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828sitting.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828bustle.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":35524,"PostDate":1174336561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's THE dress.. I felt beautiful in it and didn't worry about it being too fancy because of the plain bottom in front and the bustle but I didn't order it because I wanted to see if I could find it cheaper (which I did). Anyhow I'm 98% sure I'm ordering this tomorrow. Do you think a lace up back would work? I'm worried it will take away from the back, but I like how they make a dress feel secure.<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828front.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828sitting.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828bustle.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Casablanca3%2010\/Casablanca1828Back.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s22\/cheese_diva\/Maddie%20cake%20smash\/032.jpg\">http:\/\/i148.photobucket.com\/albums\/s...0smash\/032.jpg<\/a><br><span>faberphotography.com<\/span><br><span><a href=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lilypie.com\/\">http:\/\/lilypie.com\/<\/a><span>\"><img src=\"<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/Yg4Cm8.png\">http:\/\/lb2f.lilypie.com\/Yg4Cm8.png<\/a><span>\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Lilypie Second Birthday tickers\" \/><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cheese_diva@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1159937880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206995.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cheese_diva","Id":206995,"Name":"cheese_diva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cf7b581418eff54349545670952a4b1","RawContent":"I&#039;m so excited!!!!! My dress came today!!!! So its not any of the dresses I posted before, I never even tried it on until today, and I love,love, love, it, I didn&#039;t want to take it off. And what makes me even happier is that I got such a sweet deal on it. I got it on ebay, from a bridal salon, it was a sample, it retails for around $1000, I paid, $225 including shipping. So excited!!! I couldn&#039;t take pics of me in it, FI is here, so I had to try it quick before he interupted. I got it in ivory, its lighter than it looks in the picture. The biggest picture is the dress and I also posted the link to it, so you can see it up closer. Let me know what you think.\n \n P.S. Angela, I love lace up backs to, thats what I got, and they suck you in so good, but I do think it might take away from the back of yours because they&#039;d have to cut out some of the detail. But whatever make you feel comfy!\n \n \n \n \n okay, pic didn&#039;t work, but in the link its the largest picture shown, and you can click it to enlarge and see the back up close\n \n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.andaluziacouture.com\/collections\/index.php?pag=1&amp;amp;imagen=102074#\"&gt;Andaluzia Couture - Web Site&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":35577,"PostDate":1174350044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm so excited!!!!! My dress came today!!!! So its not any of the dresses I posted before, I never even tried it on until today, and I love,love, love, it, I didn't want to take it off. And what makes me even happier is that I got such a sweet deal on it. I got it on ebay, from a bridal salon, it was a sample, it retails for around $1000, I paid, $225 including shipping. So excited!!! I couldn't take pics of me in it, FI is here, so I had to try it quick before he interupted. I got it in ivory, its lighter than it looks in the picture. The biggest picture is the dress and I also posted the link to it, so you can see it up closer. Let me know what you think.<br \/> <br \/> P.S. Angela, I love lace up backs to, thats what I got, and they suck you in so good, but I do think it might take away from the back of yours because they'd have to cut out some of the detail. But whatever make you feel comfy!<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> okay, pic didn't work, but in the link its the largest picture shown, and you can click it to enlarge and see the back up close<br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.andaluziacouture.com\/collections\/index.php?pag=1&imagen=102074#' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Andaluzia Couture - Web Site<\/a><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/bunny_4.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Bunny 4\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jill@...","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1162169940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206877.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*JillD*","Id":206877,"Name":"*JillD*","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8275,"TotalPages":828,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":8270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
