  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My dress is the jcrew Vivian Dress. I am having a problem posting the picture.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i140.photobucket.com\/albums\/r39\/jessalynj_2007\/viviancopy.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/545466b4cf20ed06.bmp\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/fo...b4cf20ed06.bmp<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kay726@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1160753940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206854.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":76,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kay726","Id":206854,"Name":"kay726","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"016d1190cb65fe159386de6c0cf28e7c","RawContent":"So I finally got a picture of my dress with me in it and i am REALLY having my doubts. It&#039;s a pretty dress but just seems too formal for the beach wedding. Ugh...I don&#039;t know what to do &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/sad.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Sad\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;. It&#039;s driving me crazy.\n \n &amp;lt;img src=&amp;quot;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/al