ith a train) and the one above for the reception since it will be easier for me to move around in.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ocasiojessica@aol.com","IpAddress":"72.82.169.76","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1174588020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207276.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica","Id":207276,"Name":"Jessica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ece9291c10663d0d5a0246a6dd76719","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;akh&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Natalie? You said you saw your dress on the Knot Specialty Bios I posted ... I&#039;m waiting to see it posted on here ...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Ann, this is the dress but still no real picture of it but here is the drawing of it. Thanks again for the info. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i116.photobucket.com\/albums\/o4\/gnat1711\/of50366442.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":37798,"PostDate":1174956018,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>akh<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Natalie? You said you saw your dress on the Knot Specialty Bios I posted ... I'm waiting to see it posted on here ...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Ann, this is the dress but still no real picture of it but here is the drawing of it. Thanks again for the info. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i116.photobucket.com\/albums\/o4\/gnat1711\/of50366442.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"gnat1711@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1160497500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206849.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":73,"PhotoHeight":99,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Natalie Z","Id":206849,"Name":"Natalie Z","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f054e3152befecf0bb9387791fbbbbee","RawContent":"Here is my dress (just realized I have never posted it): These pictures are from my first try-on, still waiting for the dress to come in for the actual fitting.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_69146098e1662996.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":38156,"PostDate":1175031324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is my dress (just realized I have never posted it): These pictures are from my first try-on, still waiting for the dress to come in for the actual fitting.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_69146098e1662996.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb263\/jwhitmer\/CampbellElizabethWhitmerNewborn010.jpg\">http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/b...Newborn010.jpg<\/a><br><strong>Shane<\/strong><span> & <\/span><strong>Campbell<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniferpendleton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1164143700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206923.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":89,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jpkw","Id":206923,"Name":"jpkw","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26ad6635e2bfe936b15784b6cb808b48","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;TAMMYM&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Jen I read in another thread that you just posted you dress, so I had to run over here and take a look. VERY PRETTY.. it really does look awesome on you and just think if it looks that good on you know, just think how beautiful it will look when it actually fits the way it should.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Thanks Tammy! You are so sweet!! I&#039;m nervous for my first fitting...\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;MrsV-to-be&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;That is beautiful! I love it! Who made it?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;It&#039;s by Pronovias - a spanish designer. &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.pronovias.com\/entrada_index.asp?idioma=2\"&gt;Pronovias - Vestidos de novia y trajes de novia - Wedding dresses and bridal gowns&lt;\/a&gt;\n I got it at a little bridal store near me in LA, actually it was pretty cheap (for a wedding dress).","Attachments":[],"Id":38320,"PostDate":1175057667,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>TAMMYM<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Jen I read in another thread that you just posted you dress, so I had to run over here and take a look. VERY PRETTY.. it really does look awesome on you and just think if it looks that good on you know, just think how beautiful it will look when it actually fits the way it should.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Thanks Tammy! You are so sweet!! I'm nervous for my first fitting...<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>MrsV-to-be<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">That is beautiful! I love it! Who made it?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>It's by Pronovias - a spanish designer. <a href='http:\/\/www.pronovias.com\/entrada_index.asp?idioma=2' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Pronovias - Vestidos de novia y trajes de novia - Wedding dresses and bridal gowns<\/a><br \/> I got it at a little bridal store near me in LA, actually it was pretty cheap (for a wedding dress).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/bb263\/jwhitmer\/CampbellElizabethWhitmerNewborn010.jpg\">http:\/\/i210.photobucket.com\/albums\/b...Newborn010.jpg<\/a><br><strong>Shane<\/strong><span> & <\/span><strong>Campbell<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jenniferpendleton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1164143700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206923.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":89,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jpkw","Id":206923,"Name":"jpkw","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"da252da65021cf8755fb771ed417c7b1","RawContent":"Here is the link to the gallery, so we don&#039;t have to flip through all 119 pages... and counting\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/s167.photobucket.com\/albums\/u137\/bdwgallery\/\"&gt;bdwgallery - Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":38672,"PostDate":1175127305,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the link to the gallery, so we don't have to flip through all 119 pages... and counting<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/s167.photobucket.com\/albums\/u137\/bdwgallery\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>bdwgallery - Photobucket - Video and Image Hosting<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shell4u2@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1174613640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207282.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":216,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mishi","Id":207282,"Name":"Mishi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ff92c4ca20ce04111632231d6a44634","RawContent":"Wow. There are so many gorgeous dresses. I wish I could have more than one!\n \n Here&#039;s a picture of mine. This is just the sample from the store &amp;amp; I&#039;ve lost about 5 lbs since I ordered it . I won&#039;t have my dress for another month or two (when I hope to be another 5 lbs lighter!).\n \n Thanks for compiling the gallery! It&#039;s great to have all of the pictures in one place.\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1130460b1f28a0738.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":38702,"PostDate":1175134163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow. There are so many gorgeous dresses. I wish I could have more than one!<br \/> <br \/> Here's a picture of mine. This is just the sample from the store & I've lost about 5 lbs since I ordered it . I won't have my dress for another month or two (when I hope to be another 5 lbs lighter!).<br \/> <br \/> Thanks for compiling the gallery! It's great to have all of the pictures in one place.<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_1130460b1f28a0738.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"elizabeth@enteronline.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1171759932,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207182.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lvpbride","Id":207182,"Name":"lvpbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3aaabb9a2d9052ae9e6d74c8928b639e","RawContent":"I have been asked this by some people on here and lots of friends and family, so, I just wanted to show you all what I mean. I want to make my dress\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_847460aaeb368c30.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Into a halter. I tried on another dress similar and it came with a halter strap, so this is all I want to do to it. Here is the dress I am using as my inspriation for making mine halter. (I hope this works, it would not let me host it cause its too big)\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.moncheribridals.com\/Bridals\/StyleDetail.aspx?dvid=497&amp;amp;pid=424&amp;amp;did=260\"&gt;Mon Cheri Bridals - Style Detail&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I hope everyone gets what I mean now. lol Its simple, but I like it better than strapless.","Attachments":[],"Id":39061,"PostDate":1175268154,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have been asked this by some people on here and lots of friends and family, so, I just wanted to show you all what I mean. I want to make my dress<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/imagehosting\/thum_847460aaeb368c30.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/a><br \/> <br \/> Into a halter. I tried on another dress similar and it came with a halter strap, so this is all I want to do to it. Here is the dress I am using as my inspriation for making mine halter. (I hope this works, it would not let me host it cause its too big)<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.moncheribridals.com\/Bridals\/StyleDetail.aspx?dvid=497&pid=424&did=260' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Mon Cheri Bridals - Style Detail<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I hope everyone gets what I mean now. lol Its simple, but I like it better than strapless.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"graberjul@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.230.91","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1168108500,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207027.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":283,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JulieG","Id":207027,"Name":"JulieG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58ab52e087d06313fb6367e2c5bbec09","RawContent":"I had my first fitting yesterday! I was holding out as long as possible because I wanted to lose a few more pounds, but I just had to get it done. Anyway, here are a couple pics. Sorry for the bad hair and red face- just had an IPL treatment a couple days ago! \n I couldn&#039;t decide on what kind of bustle to do. I really wanted a French bustle, but I just didn&#039;t have confidence that my friends\/family would be able to figure out how to bustle it right, so I just went with the regular bustle. one button and loop and it&#039;s done! I also had the seamstress make the cathedral part of my veil detachable so after the wedding I can just wear the fingertip blusher as my veil. \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress003-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress002-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":39174,"PostDate":1175288777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had my first fitting yesterday! I was holding out as long as possible because I wanted to lose a few more pounds, but I just had to get it done. Anyway, here are a couple pics. Sorry for the bad hair and red face- just had an IPL treatment a couple days ago! <br \/> I couldn't decide on what kind of bustle to do. I really wanted a French bustle, but I just didn't have confidence that my friends\/family would be able to figure out how to bustle it right, so I just went with the regular bustle. one button and loop and it's done! I also had the seamstress make the cathedral part of my veil detachable so after the wedding I can just wear the fingertip blusher as my veil. <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress006.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress003-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i108.photobucket.com\/albums\/n26\/AQHARider\/dress002-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aqharider@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"76.20.179.61","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1154373780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/9f\/9fd8e240_user-274-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah","Id":206770,"Name":"Sarah","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a58c3ab991f93ec91fd8d92e72b7e152","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/i173.photobucket.com\/albums\/w80\/natalieberns\/weddingdress.jpg\"&gt;http:\/\/i173.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...ddingdress.jpg&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n I bought my dress yesterday and I love it!!! It was only the third dress I tried on!","Attachments":[],"Id":40184,"PostDate":1175712196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/i173.photobucket.com\/albums\/w80\/natalieberns\/weddingdress.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/i173.photobuc....ddingdress.jpg<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> I bought my dress yesterday and I love it!!! It was only the third dress I tried on!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i173.photobucket.com\/albums\/w80\/natalieberns\/wedding\/AMB_9144BW.jpg\">http:\/\/i173.photobucket.com\/albums\/w...AMB_9144BW.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;128\/st\/20071012\/e\/the+big+day\/dt\/-3\/k\/9829\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...9829\/event.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.natalieandkevinberns.com\">www.natalieandkevinberns.com<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"natalieberns@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1153065360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206763.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TOESNTHESND","Id":206763,"Name":"TOESNTHESND","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8275,"TotalPages":828,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":8270},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
