{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.220.24.175","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8324de7485495b7a30ccfb3e3931b982","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for starting this thread! We&#039;re leaving Sun, wedding Friday but not sure if anything will be open 4th of July so I&#039;m not sure the option that will still look good a week later being in the water alot as well!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894013,"PostDate":1429745358,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for starting this thread! We're leaving Sun, wedding Friday but not sure if anything will be open 4th of July so I'm not sure the option that will still look good a week later being in the water alot as well!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsparrow@kent.edu","IpAddress":"74.218.117.250","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1400503542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jsparrow10","Id":278025,"Name":"jsparrow10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.194.103.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b1b505054df6d6065c684f303f26ef0","RawContent":"I&#039;ve had some bad luck with shellac chipping within a week! Last time I went to Jamaica, in fact. I&#039;m worried about it getting messed up while we&#039;re there and not being able to get it off. So I&#039;m doing a regular manicure the day before we leave (a Saturday) and I&#039;m doing a polish change only at the resort on wedding day (a Thursday) right before my hair\/makeup appt.","Attachments":[],"Id":1894075,"PostDate":1429794361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've had some bad luck with shellac chipping within a week! Last time I went to Jamaica, in fact. I'm worried about it getting messed up while we're there and not being able to get it off. So I'm doing a regular manicure the day before we leave (a Saturday) and I'm doing a polish change only at the resort on wedding day (a Thursday) right before my hair\/makeup appt. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa0dcf3652b7db2461d030e80918ca8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am getting gel done for mine! &amp;nbsp;I did it last time we went on vacation and took engagement photos and looked perfect after almost 2 weeks of fun in the sun. &amp;nbsp;My only dilemma is what color to get! &amp;nbsp;I want a pinkish nude color that won&#039;t look outdated or too bright in photos.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894086,"PostDate":1429797800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am getting gel done for mine! \u00a0I did it last time we went on vacation and took engagement photos and looked perfect after almost 2 weeks of fun in the sun. \u00a0My only dilemma is what color to get! \u00a0I want a pinkish nude color that won't look outdated or too bright in photos.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd8ff0c199c0d64dbd41d524936aa43d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I&#039;m obsessed!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\" alt=\"ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"beckys98\"] - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure. &amp;nbsp;If the technician doesn&#039;t do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they&#039;re doing, it&#039;s almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n@[member=\"Sabes44\"] - &amp;nbsp;I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it&#039;ll look really neutral in pictures but it&#039;s still pink enough to be pretty in person.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894530,"PostDate":1430122182,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I'm obsessed!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\" alt=\"ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure. \u00a0If the technician doesn't do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they're doing, it's almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.<\/p>\n<p>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> - \u00a0I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it'll look really neutral in pictures but it's still pink enough to be pretty in person.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388717497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35a673e8c29dc4a44b303fe63b4b3bee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1894530\" timestamp=\"1430136582\"]\nI have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I&#039;m obsessed!\n[img]http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg[\/img]\n\n\n@[member=\"beckys98\"] - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure.  If the technician doesn&#039;t do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they&#039;re doing, it&#039;s almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.\n@[member=\"Sabes44\"] -  I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it&#039;ll look really neutral in pictures but it&#039;s still pink enough to be pretty in person.[\/quote]I think I figured it out.  You use the term gel for what we say shellac for.    At my nail salon gel is like acrylic and there is no way it can chip   :) :)  \n\nYour nails look fantastic and I love the look of the sparkles falling down your nail. I know there&#039;s a term for it but it&#039;s escaping me :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1894534,"PostDate":1430125784,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 27 April 2015 - 08:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I'm obsessed!<br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\" alt=\"ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure.  If the technician doesn't do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they're doing, it's almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.<br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> -  I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it'll look really neutral in pictures but it's still pink enough to be pretty in person.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI think I figured it out.  You use the term gel for what we say shellac for.    At my nail salon gel is like acrylic and there is no way it can chip   <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>  <br><br>\nYour nails look fantastic and I love the look of the sparkles falling down your nail. I know there's a term for it but it's escaping me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7baf61d7a2e1b66600d5b86a0d226da5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] glitter ombr\u00e8!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The gel\/shellac thing is super confusing because everyone calls it different things. &amp;nbsp;For me, gel polish is the overall term for the kind that lasts 2 weeks that they cure under a LED or UV light. Shellac was the first kind gel polish on the market so a lot of people use it as a blanket term, myself included when I&#039;m just talking about it in real life, but on here I try to use the all-inclusive \"gel polish,\" since that includes a bunch of brands, including OPI, which is my favorite. &amp;nbsp;I actually like official \"Shellac\" brand gel polish the least - it hasn&#039;t seemed to last as long on my nails as OPI.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894537,"PostDate":1430126374,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> glitter ombr\u00e8!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The gel\/shellac thing is super confusing because everyone calls it different things. \u00a0For me, gel polish is the overall term for the kind that lasts 2 weeks that they cure under a LED or UV light. Shellac was the first kind gel polish on the market so a lot of people use it as a blanket term, myself included when I'm just talking about it in real life, but on here I try to use the all-inclusive \"gel polish,\" since that includes a bunch of brands, including OPI, which is my favorite. \u00a0I actually like official \"Shellac\" brand gel polish the least - it hasn't seemed to last as long on my nails as OPI.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388717497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60a1b56f35ac135320df849a4d0d7112","RawContent":"I agree I use shellac as the blanket term.   I use gel as the other term against acrylic. So not sure what else to call it either as it&#039;s certainly not a &#039;polish&#039;.  \n\n\nOmbr\u00e9 is a great term!!!  I did mine this weekend after all this talk and for once tried the one nail different. It&#039;s growing on me.  I never wear full polish so this is huge for me. Usually just have the colored tips. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1894542,"PostDate":1430127183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree I use shellac as the blanket term.   I use gel as the other term against acrylic. So not sure what else to call it either as it's certainly not a 'polish'.  <br><br>\nOmbr\u00e9 is a great term!!!  I did mine this weekend after all this talk and for once tried the one nail different. It's growing on me.  I never wear full polish so this is huge for me. Usually just have the colored tips. <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1894542]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277873-143014155511.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1430141554.464285.jpg -  193KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-277873-143014155511.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1430141554.464285.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97660fbf94e29eaee0014be0eb7f0296","RawContent":"Love the glitter! That is super cute!\n[quote name=\"rachelia160\" post=\"1894530\" timestamp=\"1430136582\"]\nI have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I&#039;m obsessed!\n[img]http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg[\/img]\n\n\n@[member=\"beckys98\"] - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure.  If the technician doesn&#039;t do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they&#039;re doing, it&#039;s almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.\n@[member=\"Sabes44\"] -  I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it&#039;ll look really neutral in pictures but it&#039;s still pink enough to be pretty in person.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1894546,"PostDate":1430131746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love the glitter! That is super cute!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rachelia160, on 27 April 2015 - 08:09 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have to show off my gel mani I got done for my upcoming bachelorette\/shower weekend - I'm obsessed!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i15.photobucket.com\/albums\/a359\/rachelia160\/ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\" alt=\"ab7c9431-837e-4b18-800f-66bd7331fc01.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278581\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278581-beckys98\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">beckys98<\/span><\/a> - the duration of gel polish is totally dependent on how well the person does your manicure. \u00a0If the technician doesn't do a good job, it could chip within days, but if you go to a place that really knows what they're doing, it's almost impossible to have it chip. If you still were thinking of doing a gel manicure, I would just maybe try a different salon that has really good Yelp reviews for their shellac\/gel.<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278603-sabes44\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sabes44<\/span><\/a> - \u00a0I was looking for the exact same pink\/nude color you mentioned and I love how this looks on my nails! I think it'll look really neutral in pictures but it's still pink enough to be pretty in person.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cad80d71d561b9caed8d91cfc8a34eb1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\"&gt;rachelia160 &amp;nbsp;Pretty!! &amp;nbsp;What color is the base? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894556,"PostDate":1430137020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold\">rachelia160 \u00a0Pretty!! \u00a0What color is the base? \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79094,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1430148762,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d711ab4f4dddc55626654f5bc9a5c5d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did Gel nails with extensions (my nails were bit down from all the nerves Lol) for my wedding. They looked great! I had them done on the Tuesday, we left on Wednesday, and the wedding was on Saturday. They looked great even when we returned, a full 2 weeks later!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I did gel because I had done gel polish or shellac on my nails with no extension for a previous trip and one nail chipped with transferring luggage etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know from past experience that acrylic turns yellowish in the sun\/chlorine etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really like Bubble Bath from OPI (they have it in gel too) and Care to Danse from OPI also.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894590,"PostDate":1430148743,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did Gel nails with extensions (my nails were bit down from all the nerves Lol) for my wedding. They looked great! I had them done on the Tuesday, we left on Wednesday, and the wedding was on Saturday. They looked great even when we returned, a full 2 weeks later!!!<\/p>\n<p>I did gel because I had done gel polish or shellac on my nails with no extension for a previous trip and one nail chipped with transferring luggage etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know from past experience that acrylic turns yellowish in the sun\/chlorine etc.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really like Bubble Bath from OPI (they have it in gel too) and Care to Danse from OPI also.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;0;6\/st\/20150314\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/c1c3\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"tiffmedeiros@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.177.38.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361723426,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266526.jpg?_r=1427840086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsCtoB","Id":266526,"Name":"MrsCtoB","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}